Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.90,0:00:40.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,《洛奇5》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.20,0:00:19.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女士们  先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.01,0:00:30.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在苏联的莫斯科\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in Moscow,in the Soviet Union.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.89,0:00:33.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这肯定是拳击史上最多人观看的一场比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This promises to be the most-watched event in boxing history.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.39,0:00:44.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要击败你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must break you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.45,0:00:50.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到右边去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Throw your right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.76,0:00:52.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他把洛奇困在角落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will not let him out of that corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.39,0:00:54.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.14,0:00:58.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇身陷困境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky Balboa is in serious trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.20,0:01:01.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他毫无招架之力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's getting killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.40,0:01:06.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,德拉戈挥拳猛击洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drago continuing to punish Rocky Balboa.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.21,0:01:11.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不痛  - 不痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No pain! - No pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.18,0:01:17.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇惨遭修理  洛奇受伤了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky's been hit with bombs. Rocky's hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.65,0:01:23.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,德拉戈一记右拳把洛奇打得倒飞15英尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The right hand from Drago sends Rocky Balboa 15 feet across the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.72,0:01:25.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳王被击倒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The champ is down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.96,0:01:28.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  快起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky,Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.23,0:01:34.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目前的战况是一面倒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been a one-sided fight so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.10,0:01:38.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,德拉戈一记猛烈的右拳把洛奇打得头昏脑胀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drago throws a hard right hand and stuns Rocky Balboa!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.97,0:01:44.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再不停止比赛就要出人命了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They might have to stop this one before somebody gets killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.62,0:01:52.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇惨遭一轮重拳  他已欲振乏力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky taking punishment! He's completely exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.46,0:02:07.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇又被一记右钩拳击倒在地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balboa goes down again from a right hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.01,0:02:19.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重拳有如排山倒海  惊人的意志力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lethal punch after punch. Amazing willpower!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.38,0:02:26.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇到目前还招架得住德拉戈的每一拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky Balboa has taken all of Drago's best punches.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.99,0:02:28.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他已经是血流满面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's cut and bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.99,0:02:31.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.02,0:02:33.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我看见三个影子  - 打中间那个影子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I see three of him out there. - Hit the one in the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.66,0:02:36.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  打中间那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right! Hit the one in the middle!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.56,0:02:40.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 俄国选手流血了  - 打倒他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The Russian's cut! - Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.45,0:02:58.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像摔角手般扭倒在地  简直是市井小民的打法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the ground like a wrestler! It's a gutter war.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.19,0:03:00.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫斯科的拳赛完全不设限\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No holds barred in Moscow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.19,0:03:03.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用尽你的全力  使出浑身解数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All your strength,power. Everything you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.15,0:03:05.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关乎你一生前途\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is your whole life!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.23,0:03:08.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇一记右钩拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A good right hand by Rocky Balboa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.10,0:03:17.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇赢得不可能的比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky Balboa has done the impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.88,0:03:30.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky! Rocky!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.23,0:03:42.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从未见过这种场面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never saw nothing like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.93,0:03:48.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以拳王的精神坚持到底  你和大家都无比光荣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You came through like the champ you are. Did yourself and everybody proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.57,0:03:50.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尤其是阿波罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Especially Apollo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.83,0:03:54.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 汤尼  - 怎么了  宝贝  你需要什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yo,Tony. - What is it,baby? What do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.41,0:03:56.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫艾莉来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get Adrian.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.16,0:04:13.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家在外面还好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's everybody doing out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.13,0:04:16.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Everything's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.10,0:04:19.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.97,0:04:22.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.74,0:04:27.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还记得米克说过当年他出赛时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember when Mick said when he was fightin'...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.54,0:04:30.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时候出力过猛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sometimes he'd fight so hard...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.31,0:04:35.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉就好像...五脏六腑全散掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that he was thinking he broke somethin' inside...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.95,0:04:39.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他好像快死了一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he was gonna die?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.39,0:04:43.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说这时候就像天使在召唤他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what he said when the angels was pullin' on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.39,0:04:46.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你吓坏我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky,you're scaring me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.39,0:04:47.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.96,0:04:49.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉  我不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adrian,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.90,0:04:52.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.90,0:04:56.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...我不能停止我的双手颤动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I...I can't stop my hands from shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.07,0:05:03.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 以前从没这样子  - 你必须要看医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I never felt this thing. - We've gotta see a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.11,0:05:06.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不  我只想回家  - 回家?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. No,I just wanna go home. - Home?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.75,0:05:08.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对  - 不看医生吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - Not see a doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.41,0:05:13.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是累了  我想回家  米克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just tired. I just wanna go home,Mick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.49,0:05:15.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是累了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.29,0:05:20.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只想回家 好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wanna go home,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.51,0:05:45.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 艾莉  孩子呢?  - 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Adrian,where's the kid? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.15,0:05:49.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没看见孩子  他在哪里?  他不在这里吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't see the kid. Where's the kid? Ain't he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.86,0:05:52.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.13,0:05:56.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在这  小拳王  你好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is! Hey,Slugger! How you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.36,0:05:58.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向你妈问候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say hi to your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.40,0:06:00.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 忘了叫我吗?  - 保罗叔叔  你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm forgotten now? - Hi,Uncle Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.53,0:06:03.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你感觉怎么样?  - 身上还有几个伤口  学校还好吗 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dad,how you feeling? - I got a few dents. How's school?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.40,0:06:05.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我上荣誉榜了  - 很棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I made the honor roll. - Beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.54,0:06:07.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是希拉·唐丝  安全人员 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Sheila Downs,Airport Security.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.65,0:06:10.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请跟我来  记者会正在等你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Welcome. There's a press reception.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.01,0:06:14.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  你对俄国民众感觉如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky,how did you feel about the Russian people in general?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.25,0:06:17.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好  他们都很友善\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very good. They was great people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.08,0:06:20.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听不懂俄语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't understand what they was speaking...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.02,0:06:22.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我明白他们的意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I understood what they was meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.42,0:06:25.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 洛奇太太  你学了几句俄语吧?  - 我有没有学俄语? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mrs. Balboa,did you learn any Russian? - Did I learn Russian?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.53,0:06:28.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她说伏特加很流畅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She got fluent in vodka.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.00,0:06:32.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  听说你比赛后身体不适\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are rumors of physical complications after the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.57,0:06:34.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 身体不适?  - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Complications? - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.67,0:06:39.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些只是谣传  他身体好的很\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those were rumors. He's in perfect physical condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.27,0:06:46.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有个问题  美国医学协会最近建议禁止举行拳赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky,the American Medical Association recommended boxing be banned.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.58,0:06:48.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你同意他们的看法吗?  - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you agree with the doctors? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.62,0:06:52.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对同意  我认为医生不该参加拳赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely. I think that doctors should never fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.75,0:06:55.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳王  你答得太妙了  没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was a beautiful answer,champ! That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.02,0:06:59.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,医生应该远离拳击场  更不该比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctors should stay out of the ring forever,and never fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.93,0:07:02.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇·巴尔博亚  最幽默的拳王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky Balboa,the funkiest champion ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.40,0:07:05.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国的洛奇·巴尔博亚  你好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}American's own Rocky Balboa. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.70,0:07:08.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是乔治·华盛顿·杜克  卓越的拳赛赞助者...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}George Washington Duke here. Promoter extraordinaire...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.74,0:07:14.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎回国  洛奇  全美及全苏联的拳王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}welcoming back Rocky Balboa,champion of all the Americans and Russians!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.14,0:07:19.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在想先拉开话题  在媒体面前提出一项提议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would like to digress and pose an interesting proposition to the media.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.41,0:07:21.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全市的居民...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone in this city...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.75,0:07:24.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及体育界的人士都知道我在国内...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and in sports knows my reputation for promoting...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.52,0:07:28.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,曾主办无数精彩的比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some of the finest extravaganzas in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.72,0:07:34.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以趁新闻界都在场时  我郑重请求洛奇·巴尔博亚...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So,with the press present,I'd like to ask you,Rocky Balboa...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.06,0:07:38.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是个灿烂  桀骜不驯的运动员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to be the flamboyant,rambunctious sportsman we know you can be...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.53,0:07:42.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给尤尼·肯恩这位年轻人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and give this man here,Union Cane,a chance to challenge you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.20,0:07:44.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与你争夺世界重量级拳王的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the Heavyweight Championship of the World.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.34,0:07:49.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴尔博亚  我要夺走你的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balboa,I want the opportunity to take what you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.01,0:07:53.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时机不对吧?  他才刚下飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't this bad timing to present a challenger? He just got off the plane!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.18,0:07:55.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时机是生活的要素  各位先生女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Timing is the essence of life,gentlemen and ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.82,0:07:59.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我手上这纸合约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I have on this paper is the largest guarantee...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.49,0:08:02.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,提供的是世上最优渥的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ever offered to a champion on this planet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.76,0:08:07.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说的是  在日本举办规模最大的国际拳赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm talking about a fantastic international extravaganza to be held...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.69,0:08:11.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,称为"放手一搏在东京"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in Japan called "Lettin' It Go in Tokyo."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.20,0:08:13.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有在美国  我们这种人才有机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People,ain't it incredible that only in America...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.87,0:08:17.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脱离压迫  脱离贫穷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}could people like us rise from oppression,from poverty...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.14,0:08:20.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,携手参加国际性大赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to join hands in this international event?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.27,0:08:23.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 只有在美国  - 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Excuse me. - Only in America!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.81,0:08:29.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起  我先生退休了  他不想再证明什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My husband is retired. He has nothing more to prove.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.68,0:08:33.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下  洛奇  你不认为有责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute! Rocky,don't you consider this a public responsibility...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.89,0:08:36.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽快回应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to respond now rather than later?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.02,0:08:38.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回应公众\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Respond to the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.19,0:08:41.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道这不是一个现在就要回答的专业问题吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't this a question of professionalism to talk about it now,not later?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.63,0:08:43.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不介意等我康复吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mind if I heal first?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.96,0:08:46.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的伤不够看  我的拳头更厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The whippin' you got ain't nothin' like what I got here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.37,0:08:47.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是什么意思?  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What in the hell does this all mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.73,0:08:50.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 这样的回答不够  我现在就要知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That isn't enough. We gotta hear now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.40,0:08:52.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还要考虑一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got to think about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.51,0:08:57.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之  这趟旅行非常愉快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway,the flight over was really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.78,0:08:59.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还要更多答案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys,we need more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.51,0:09:02.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉  如果没有你  我表现不会这么好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adrian,if you weren't with me,I never would have done as good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.68,0:09:06.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是我的挚爱  你永远都支持我  还有我的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're my Adrian. You're always there. And my kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.05,0:09:09.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了你就好像重生一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Having you is like bein' born all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.42,0:09:12.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点  你意下如何?  你究竟要不要退休? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,what do you say? Are you gonna retire or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.66,0:09:15.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起  我想回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. I'd like to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.60,0:09:19.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你不给我们一些答案吗?  - 谢谢各位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Give us something to write! - Thank you,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.43,0:09:21.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.00,0:09:28.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你放心  你一定能逼他出赛的  一定没问题的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry. You'll get him. You'll get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.43,0:09:51.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  真的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,really,it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.56,0:09:56.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很棒  看看这个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah,yo! Look at this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.04,0:10:00.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我发誓再也不离开这里了  知道吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear I ain't never leavin' this place again,you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.14,0:10:02.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想不想跳舞?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,would you like to dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.91,0:10:06.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 陪我跳支载誉归国舞?  - 别傻了  天气好冷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How about a homecoming dance? - Don't be silly,it's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.21,0:10:09.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小姐  我帮你暖身  来吧  跳支舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll warm you up,young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.28,0:10:12.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点  音乐快结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry up. The music's almost over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.69,0:10:15.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你喜欢这首歌吗?  - 你该好好休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're like the song... - You should rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.89,0:10:17.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我知道  - 我累了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I know. - I'm tired. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.89,0:10:21.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许我该带你上楼  好好亲热一番\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I'll take you upstairs and violate you like a parking meter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.99,0:10:27.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你得花钱  - 艾莉  你从哪里学会说黄色笑话的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cost you a quarter. - Where'd you learn to talk dirty?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.40,0:10:31.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保罗叔?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uncle Paulie?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.64,0:10:34.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有没有觉得我爸怪怪的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you notice something strange about Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.14,0:10:36.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他只是受了点重伤罢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He just took a few hard shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.48,0:10:40.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉  你比我还会说笑话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you tell better jokes than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.78,0:10:47.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是不是听见有人找老爸?  是你吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I hear somebody call for their old man? Did you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.75,0:10:49.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子  该睡了  好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's sleep time,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.82,0:10:53.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸  你知道睡觉时  骨头的成长会快三倍吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad,did you know that your bones grow three times as fast during the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.63,0:10:57.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道  不过我听过一次  那是我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know that,but I heard somethin' like that once. Is that me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.16,0:10:59.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对  就是你  - 太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah,that's you. - Excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.40,0:11:02.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是我?  我们去钓鱼的时候?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,is that me? When we was fishin',right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.77,0:11:05.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  太美了  你看那座帐篷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's beautiful! Look at the tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.04,0:11:09.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得鱼比较大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know,the fish was a lot bigger,if I recall.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.64,0:11:11.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实比这个还小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually,that was a lot smaller.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.84,0:11:14.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终归一句话  去睡吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway,come on. Hit the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.38,0:11:16.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也该注重身体健康\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time for you to get healthy and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.85,0:11:20.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了  不知道你在哪里学的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is great how you do this. I don't know where you learn this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.49,0:11:23.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你画的真了不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is something how this thing comes out of your fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.59,0:11:26.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.30,0:11:32.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.47,0:11:36.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是杜蓬夫人  我的法文老师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Madame Dupont,my French teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.80,0:11:39.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.97,0:11:43.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  她的确有法国人的味道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,she looks French. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.74,0:11:48.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别让你妈看见这个  因为她不太懂法语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't show this to your mother 'cause she don't understand French.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.81,0:11:50.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.55,0:11:53.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最好盖起来  小拳王  该睡了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better cover that one up. Champ,it's bedtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.65,0:11:57.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道吗?  我也懂些法语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,you know what? I know some French talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.59,0:11:59.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敲敲门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knock,knock.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.09,0:12:01.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哪位?  - 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's there? - Madame.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.33,0:12:04.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哪个夫人?  - 我的脚卡在门里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Madame who? - My damn foot's caught in the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.50,0:12:08.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是个老笑话了  - 那你想怎样?我在尽力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's an old joke! - What do you want from me? I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.23,0:12:10.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我又不知道新的玩意儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know all the good things.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.84,0:12:12.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa! What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.77,0:12:14.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.11,0:12:18.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在你耳朵里找到的  俄国钱币\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look what I found in your ear. Russian money.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.08,0:12:19.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摇钱耳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Money ears!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.45,0:12:23.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  你得睡觉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right,listen,kid,you gotta get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.05,0:12:24.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 爸?  - 什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dad? - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.68,0:12:27.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你今天说有了我就像重生一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today when you said having me was like being born again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.62,0:12:30.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么了?  - 是什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah? - What did you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.29,0:12:36.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道...当你变得跟我从前一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,you know,when you come up like I did and you got...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.10,0:12:39.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每日三餐不继  了解我的意思吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}three square meals of zero a day,know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.87,0:12:42.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生活有好坏两面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got the "A" side of life and the "B" side of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.34,0:12:45.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是在穷苦中长大  可是你不愁衣食\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm like on the "B" side. But you got all the breaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.64,0:12:49.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以当我见到你拥有我所没有的一切...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So when I see you having all these things that I didn't have...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.81,0:12:53.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就好像见到自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I live through your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.51,0:12:57.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很喜欢  就好像一切又重生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I enjoy it a little bit. It's like having it all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.65,0:12:59.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.79,0:13:04.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看我的脸  像不像浣熊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,hey,look at my face. Do I look like a raccoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.76,0:13:06.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.19,0:13:07.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像洛奇浣熊吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like Rocky Raccoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.76,0:13:09.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  有点像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.56,0:13:11.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是有一点像  - 真的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You do a little. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.60,0:13:16.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你认为我很惨  不妨去看看另一个人的下场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you think I look bad,you oughta see the other guy's knuckles.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.47,0:13:22.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之  晚安  孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway,yo,good night. Okay,kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.45,0:13:28.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸  很高兴你回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Glad you're home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.01,0:13:30.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢  非常感激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks. I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.48,0:13:32.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天再玩  好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll play tomorrow,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.55,0:13:34.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许你可以让我看看你的英文老师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you could show me your English teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.92,0:13:37.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她也很火辣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's pretty hot,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.86,0:13:40.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安  孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night,kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.79,0:13:45.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那不是你的钱  是洛奇的  - 你疯了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It wasn't your money. It was Rocky's. - You wanna be hysterical?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.73,0:13:48.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你害我们家当都没了  - 那是个错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You cost us everything. - It was a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.80,0:13:53.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你以为我知道这一切会发生吗?  - 不准你一走了之\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You think I thought this would happen? - Don't walk away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.17,0:13:56.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你毁了我们的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just gave up our life!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.44,0:13:58.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还以为只是小错而已?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you think it's like some stupid thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.94,0:14:03.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保罗  你知道你做了什么吗?  你可知严重性? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paulie,do you know what you did? Do you know the seriousness of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.18,0:14:05.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我明白  - 那就回答我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I understand it! - Then answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.48,0:14:08.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什么都了解  我懂 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand the whole friggin' thing! I understand it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.82,0:14:12.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的会计是骗子  不是我  我做自认是对的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your accountant's a crook,not me! I did what I thought was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.99,0:14:16.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别怪我  我更想杀了那混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't blame me! I wanna murder the bum worse than anybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.86,0:14:18.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉  怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.96,0:14:21.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧你做的好事  她要把烂摊子丢给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look what you've done now. She's dumping everything on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.83,0:14:25.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 保罗 别怪在我头上  - 你到底做了什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Paulie,don't turn this around on me. - What'd you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.37,0:14:28.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他竟把委任状交给会计师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He gave power of attorney to our accountant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.64,0:14:33.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给他?  我什么都没给他  是他寄来一封信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Gave"? I just didn't "gave" anything to nobody. He sent the letter!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.38,0:14:36.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说我们要去俄国几个月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He says we're gonna be in Russia for a couple of months...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.08,0:14:38.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就要求洛奇签份税金展延申请书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and,"I need Rocky to sign a tax extension."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.75,0:14:42.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,税金展延申请书  保罗  那是委任状\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tax extension! That was a power of attorney,Paulie!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.52,0:14:45.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是个贼  我要喝酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the thief! I need alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.73,0:14:49.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  老天有眼  我一毛钱也没偷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky,on my eyes,I never stole a friggin' dime.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.53,0:14:52.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉  怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adrian,what's happenin' here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.40,0:14:54.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 全完了  - 什么完了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's gone. - What's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.47,0:14:56.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The money.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.07,0:14:58.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切全没了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything. It's all gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.77,0:15:03.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保罗叫你签字的文件不是税金展延申请书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The piece of paper Paulie had you sign wasn't a request for a tax extension.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.28,0:15:07.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是一份空白委任状  支付给会计师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a blanket power of attorney,in favor of the accountant...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.48,0:15:10.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他正从事一些高价的房地产交易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who was involved in high-priced commercial real estate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.38,0:15:12.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他以为可以趁你不注意 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He thought he could flip it,take his profit...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.45,0:15:14.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,周转一下再补回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and have the money back before you knew it was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.79,0:15:17.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不幸的是  你和在坐的所有人...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And unfortunately for you and everybody in this room...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.66,0:15:19.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的交易没有成功 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}his deals fell through because
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.19,0:15:22.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由于市场萎缩  你损失了数百万元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} the market dried up,and you lost millions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.16,0:15:24.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么  你想说什么?  我一点办法都没有?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So,what are you saying? There ain't nothin' I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.26,0:15:26.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,办法很多  我已告他八项罪名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm doing plenty. I've filed eight criminal acts against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.80,0:15:29.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你有一大堆债务要还\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you've got tremendous debt payment on this property.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.50,0:15:33.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他六年没替你缴税  而且房屋贷款也还没有偿付\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't pay your tax returns,and the house mortgage hasn't been paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.97,0:15:37.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下  我们没有贷款  房屋贷款早就付清了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. We didn't have a mortgage. Our house was fully paid for.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.51,0:15:39.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我这么说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then ask him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.25,0:15:42.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,显然不是  你们还差四十万贷款未缴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apparently not. There's nearly $400,000 still outstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.88,0:15:46.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目前唯一未负债的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only thing that's not encumbered is a gym...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.49,0:15:50.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是米克高米在1982年  遗留给你儿子的体育馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that was willed to your son by a Mickey Goldmill in 1982.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.69,0:15:53.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以拍卖东西  还记得你拍过的广告吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could sell some things. Remember those commercials you did?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.19,0:15:57.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是拍广告的  我是拳击手  靠双拳吃饭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't no commercial kind of guy. I'm a fighter. It's what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.63,0:15:59.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了  我们也找不到人赞助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just as well. We couldn't get any sponsors.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.70,0:16:03.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在调查会计师的同时 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With the investigation of the accountant out pops Rocky's criminal record...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.30,0:16:05.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会扯出洛奇从前讨债打人的案底\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for assault in connection with loan sharking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.54,0:16:09.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那是很久以前的事了  - 何不举办拳赛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That was long ago. - Why not a couple more fights?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.14,0:16:12.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以你的名气  很快就能解决困境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With your popularity now,you could be out of this in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.31,0:16:13.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要退休了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's retiring.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.65,0:16:15.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳赛是好办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fighting's the ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.35,0:16:19.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说他已经退休了  保罗  造成我们今天的局面全要怪你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said,he's retired! Paulie,we're here because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.15,0:16:23.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不接受这种说法  我认为我做的很聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not takin' the heat for this. I thought I was doin' smart business.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.49,0:16:25.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认为你很聪明?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You thought you did smart business?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.72,0:16:29.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 都是你 - 我? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You! - Me? What are you talking about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.03,0:16:33.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你要这样  我马上联络他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should have known he was a thief,b
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.18,0:16:49.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  洛奇  求求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Rocky,please!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.01,0:16:51.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能那样下去  打几场拳赛就能解决问题了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't go down like that. A couple of fights,we're out of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.92,0:16:53.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说过你不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said you wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.92,0:16:56.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什么都没说  你甘愿就这么认输吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't say anything. Did we come this far to lose it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.32,0:17:00.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你一定要看医生  - 我不需要医生  我需要主办人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You have to see a doctor. - I don't need to. I need a promoter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.23,0:17:02.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果医生同意  我一定支持你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the doctor says it's all right,I'll support you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.93,0:17:06.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定得比赛  我有麻烦 一定要出赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've gotta fight. I got problems,I gotta fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.70,0:17:09.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯为我去看医生吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you do it for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.54,0:17:12.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  为了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right,for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.54,0:17:17.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由于头部不断受到重击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because of the continuous violent blows to the head,you've developed...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.28,0:17:20.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,导致你的脑部产生拳手常见的膈腔薄膜穿孔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a condition particular to boxers called cavum septum pellucidum...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.58,0:17:24.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是脑膜中有洞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which is a hole in the membrane separating the ventricles.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.45,0:17:28.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脑部这个部位的表面神经也受伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The brain's surface neurons in this area have also been traumatized.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.15,0:17:29.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,医生  你说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.46,0:17:33.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简单地说  就是你的脑部已经受伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simply stated, it means you've suffered brain damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.53,0:17:35.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要多久才能痊愈?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long until he recovers?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.96,0:17:39.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能复原\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The effects are irreversible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.10,0:17:43.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  你一定要退休\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,I... Rocky,you have to retire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.04,0:17:45.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想退休\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't wanna retire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.07,0:17:49.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不是时候  更不是这里  绝不是在这间诊室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This ain't the time to retire. Not in here. Not in no office.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.34,0:17:53.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚打完一生最棒的拳赛  你知道吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just fought the best fight of my life. I just did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.48,0:17:57.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要的是再多打几场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And all I need is a couple more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.05,0:17:59.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  洛奇  你的脑伤很严重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,Rocky! You suffered severe brain trauma!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.62,0:18:02.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他可能诊断错误  - 我不这么认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He could be wrong! Anybody could be! - I don't think he is.
