Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.54,0:26:10.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为米克爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'cause Mickey loves ya!"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.35,0:26:16.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你  米克  我也爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks,Mick. I love you,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.11,0:26:20.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老天  孩子  击败他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus. Go after him,kid. Go after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.82,0:26:22.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.56,0:26:28.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你才是天使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You was the angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.86,0:26:30.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.53,0:26:32.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另一个袖扣呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to his other cuff link?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.53,0:26:35.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道  他只给了我一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. He only give me one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.27,0:26:38.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他给了别的蹩脚货\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He gave it to some bum.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.15,0:27:29.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这  给你  别担心这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you go. Don't worry about these.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.52,0:27:31.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 走吧  保罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go,Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.96,0:27:35.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信  他竟承受得了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really can't believe it. This kid's takin' this too good. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.83,0:27:40.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  幸好我留在这里  对吗?  省了不少钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rock,it's good I kept the place,right? It saves money.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.20,0:27:41.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.83,0:27:47.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧? 在前门用铝装饰一下会很好看的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right? With a little aluminum on the front,it's a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.38,0:27:52.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.98,0:27:56.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇 欢迎回来 我们很想念你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome back,Rocky! We missed ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.52,0:28:00.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道这只是暂时的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is only temporary,you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.49,0:28:03.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.83,0:28:13.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.00,0:28:17.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 洛奇太太吗?  我是乔治·华盛顿·杜克  - 什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mrs. Balboa? George Washington Duke. - Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.67,0:28:22.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇太太  你听得见吗? 仔细听好  你一定能听得见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Balboa,can you hear it? Listen close. You must be able to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.04,0:28:27.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 听见什么?  - 游行队伍经过的声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hear what? - The parade of opportunity knocking.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.31,0:28:29.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要怎样才会明白...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What will it take to get you people...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.48,0:28:33.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是给你们机会卷土重来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to realize I'm giving you a chance to pull yourselves together again?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.58,0:28:35.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我作洛奇的经纪人  包你们财源滚滚来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me handle his career, the money will pour in,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.98,0:28:38.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们就能再过人的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can live like human beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.36,0:28:43.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好  我们是过人的日子  改天你也该试试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen,Mr. Duke. We're living like human beings. You oughta try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.83,0:28:47.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少惹我丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave my husband alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.50,0:28:52.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女人家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Women.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.91,0:29:00.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你何时开始的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When'd you start that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.98,0:29:03.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道  老毛病总改不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. It's a bad habit that comes back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.78,0:29:08.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 我们谈的不是我  谈的是你  懂吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen. We ain't talkin' about me. We're talkin' about you,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.35,0:29:10.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 洛奇  你好  - 你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rocky,how you doin',man? - How you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.66,0:29:13.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 真高兴见到你回来  - 回来的感觉真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good to see you back. - Thanks. It's great to be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.33,0:29:17.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在学校功课很好  不过在街上也要放聪明点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're real smart in school,but you gotta be smart on the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.06,0:29:18.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.66,0:29:22.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得知道谁是老大  对方是什么来头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta know who the players are and who you're talkin' to around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.23,0:29:24.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心别被人耍诈  每个人都想设计你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out for the scammers. Everybody's gonna try to scam you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.77,0:29:27.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 耍诈是什么?  - 问你爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's a scam? - Ask your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.17,0:29:29.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耍诈就像是金光党\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A scam is like a hustle.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.77,0:29:32.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他搞不懂  - 金光党就是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He don't get it. - Like a hustle's related to...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.04,0:29:35.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  记得我吗?  我是巴布的妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky! Rocky,remember me? I'm Bubba's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.65,0:29:38.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你常拿他的头当沙袋打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You used to use his head for a punching bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.28,0:29:40.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 玩得愉快  - 欢迎回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have a nice day. - Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.92,0:29:44.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 总之金光党和骗术一样  - 他听不懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Anyway,a hustle's related to a con. - He don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.69,0:29:46.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 欺骗  - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A deception. - 'Scuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.69,0:29:48.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说要当心受骗 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're saying beware of deceptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.69,0:29:52.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  非常好  你很聪明  知道吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,that's good. Absolutely. You're very smart,you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.40,0:29:56.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原子三明治店  从前不是在这里吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,ain't this where the Atomic Hoagie Shop used to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.80,0:29:58.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸  我刚到这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm new here,Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.60,0:30:01.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一带没落了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This neighborhood's comin' down with tooth decay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.37,0:30:04.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这叫做都市凋零  - 是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's called urban blight. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.18,0:30:07.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉你  这里已经破落不堪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you something. This place is blightin' everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.78,0:30:12.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,修补粉刷一番就可以了 你认为如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aluminum siding and some paint,this place could be okay again. You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.08,0:30:14.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你上学快迟到了  快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway,you'll be late for school. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.09,0:30:18.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保罗  我要和孩子私底下谈谈  男人间的对话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paulie,I wanna talk to the kid private-like,man to smaller man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.29,0:30:20.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你当我没感觉吗?  - 少来了  保罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Like I got no feelings. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.36,0:30:23.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 战争就是这样挑起的  - 放轻松  好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's how wars start. - Relax,would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.06,0:30:25.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个人的见解不同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So everybody's got an angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.06,0:30:27.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你知道吗?  - 洛奇  你运气真差\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know? - Tough break,Rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.37,0:30:29.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个人都有不正当的手段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody's got a hustle.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.37,0:30:33.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里的小孩脑筋反应快  那就是他们的生存方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like,see,these kids around here,they got street brains. That's how they live.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.37,0:30:37.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好  他们的个性跟你以前见过的大不相同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These kids ain't like... Listen. Ain't like no personalities you grew up with.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.84,0:30:40.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你一定要保持警觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you gotta stay very,very sharp around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.65,0:30:43.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我正想这么做  - 对  这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I intend to. - Yeah,intend.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.55,0:30:46.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 有时候你让我觉得很笨  - 为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sometimes you make me feel very stupid. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.99,0:30:50.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么?  因为你比我聪明 Why?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause you're smarter than me and that's a fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.22,0:30:51.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不  我不是  - 你是的 - No,I'm not.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah,you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.86,0:30:56.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你每天学习新事物  我每天忘记新事物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like every day you learn something new and I forget something new.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.59,0:30:58.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好  我们是一家人 Listen.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in this thing together.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.86,0:31:02.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你想到怎么做  不用害怕告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So if you can figure out any way to fix things up,don't be afraid to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.80,0:31:05.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要团结  因为我们是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta stick together. 'Cause what are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.74,0:31:07.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.47,0:31:09.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.47,0:31:11.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,家族队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! Home team.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.01,0:31:13.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,家族队  你说对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home team! You know,you got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.01,0:31:15.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我小时候也念这里  砖墙不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I went to this school when I was a kid. Nice bricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.48,0:31:18.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,午餐的牛奶很好喝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Used to get milk at lunch and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.02,0:31:22.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时蛮辛苦的  不过我相信你能处理的  对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was real tough then,but I think you can handle it,don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.32,0:31:24.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不行  - 你根本不知道自己在说什么!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No way! - You don't know what you're saying!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.79,0:31:29.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你能念  我就能念  我一点也不害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you went here,I can go here. I'm not scared,really.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.06,0:31:32.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.33,0:31:36.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是有一点害怕  不过这是正常的  你不觉得吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess I'm a little scared. But that's normal,don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.40,0:31:40.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  我打过72场拳赛  每一场都会害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,yeah! I had 72 fights and every one of'em,I was scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.07,0:31:44.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以这是很正常的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So,yeah,that's real,real normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.81,0:31:49.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 待会见  - 好的  孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll see you later. - Okay,kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.01,0:31:51.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是前门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's the front door.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.65,0:31:55.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系的  等一下  这是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay. Hey,wait,wait. What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.65,0:31:58.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天  这是从哪里来的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodness gracious! Where'd this come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.76,0:32:02.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然把午餐的钱藏在耳朵里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a strange place to stash your lunch money,don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.16,0:32:05.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 只是个笑话罢了  - 爸  谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's just a lunch joke. - Thanks,Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.36,0:32:07.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待会见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen,I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.77,0:32:11.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别忘了  我爱你  你是第一名  家族队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember,Daddy loves you. You're number one. Home team!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.10,0:32:14.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要守规矩  你没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just be nice,right? You'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.87,0:32:20.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要管别人的女朋友  这里的人不喜欢这一套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't mess with nobody's girlfriend. They don't like that around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.48,0:32:30.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的很担心他  他没有在这里住过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm really worried about the kid. He ain't used to living like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.52,0:32:32.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对街上的规矩完全不熟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He don't know the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.52,0:32:34.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我料想得到在学校会发生什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that school... I know what's gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.96,0:32:38.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些同学一定会找他麻烦  因为他是我儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some wise guys are gonna come up 'cause he's my kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.13,0:32:41.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们一定会整他  故意使手段对付他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They just gonna come out and give him a cheap shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.03,0:32:43.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know? I mean... Geez!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.27,0:32:45.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇先生  你好  我叫汤米·甘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Balboa. How you doin'? My name's Tommy Gunn.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.57,0:32:47.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事?  你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? How you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.31,0:32:49.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,取这个名字一定要够狠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With a name like that,you better be tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.37,0:32:52.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确实不容易  我来自俄克拉荷马州\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It ain't easy. Anyway,I come from Oklahoma.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.04,0:32:54.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的业余纪录是45胜1负\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have an amateur's record of 45 to 1 .
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.35,0:32:57.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 18岁成为职业拳手后赛过八场  - 你是拳击手?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I turned pro at 18,and had 8 fights.  - You're a fighter?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.08,0:33:01.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  我20岁了  想让你看看我本事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,I'm a fighter. Now that I'm 20,I'd like to show you what I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.39,0:33:05.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我存了四百元作为训练费用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've saved up about $400,and I could pay you for a couple weeks' training.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.49,0:33:10.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  年轻人  我有事要谈  很高兴再次见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me,young man. I have business. Good to see you again,friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.09,0:33:12.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你好吗?  - 很好  还有什么不满足的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How you doing? - Fine. What more could I ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.63,0:33:15.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 金钱和头发  - 我得去工作了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Money and hair. - I gotta go to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.03,0:33:16.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?  在哪里工作?  这里吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Where? Here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.47,0:33:18.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在简陋的健身室?  会影响形象的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a sweatbox? Can't be too good for the image.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.57,0:33:21.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 都市凋零  你要做什么  - 你刚才说什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Urban light. What are you gonna do? - What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.84,0:33:23.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是都市凋零   - 都市凋零\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Urban light. - It's urban blight.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.68,0:33:28.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你考虑重出江湖  待遇很不错的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}George would like you to put on those gloves again. It's a hell of a payday.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.11,0:33:29.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已正式退休了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm officially expired.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.75,0:33:33.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有吸引力  每场都会座无虚席\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,you have marquee value. You put butts in seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.05,0:33:36.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有头脑的生意人有钱赚就不退休\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A businessman with any brain don't retire when he can still pull in bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.96,0:33:39.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有在美国才有这种机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only in America do we get these kind of opportunities.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.29,0:33:41.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯恩14号要争夺拳王宝座\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Union Cane's goin' for the title on the 14th.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.32,0:33:43.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里有几张票  请当我们的贵宾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's some tickets, be our guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.19,0:33:45.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有把握他会接受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a strong feeling he's gonna take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.19,0:33:46.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正是你复出的时机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the time to challenge him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.76,0:33:49.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为观众喜欢看你复出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because people love comebacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.03,0:33:52.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有比落魄拳王重拾战袍...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing in boxing more commercial than a long shot comeback...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.60,0:33:55.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更具票房号召力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of a down-on-his-luck,pure Snow White underdog.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.17,0:33:59.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正如马克·吐温所说  "品德不如金钱使人尊敬"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like Mark Twain said,"Virtue has never been as respectable as money."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.04,0:34:01.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谁是马克吐温?  - 一个画家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's Twain? - He was a painter.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.81,0:34:03.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你被寄予了厚望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the Great White Hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.55,0:34:06.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说白粉吧  别妄想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean great white dope. No,forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.52,0:34:09.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少胡说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it! Hold it. Hold the bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.02,0:34:11.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道问题所在  你认为我是三岁小孩吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what the problem is. You think I was born yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.85,0:34:12.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把文件拿给他看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show him the paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.92,0:34:16.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你的体检报告  情况很糟  不过我们可以作弊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is your medical report. It's not so good,but we can work around it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.46,0:34:18.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你从哪弄来的  - 这不重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where'd you get this? - It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.80,0:34:21.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你同意出赛  乔治保证帮你弄到执照\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You agree to fight Cane,George can guarantee you'll get licensed anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.97,0:34:22.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guaranteed!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.97,0:34:25.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你能办到?  - 没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You can do this? - No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.10,0:34:29.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在复出至少值数百万  大好时机  千万别错过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This comeback's worth millions. The time and deal are hot! Caliente.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.27,0:34:30.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再赚一场也无妨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One more payday.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.81,0:34:32.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我同意  - 艾莉  你从哪里冒出来的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I agree. - Adrian,where'd you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.98,0:34:36.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你想干嘛?  - 她出现了  好像变魔术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing? - Mrs. Balboa appeared. She's magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.15,0:34:39.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不认为好笑  你想说服洛奇复出吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think you're funny. Are you trying to talk my husband into fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.85,0:34:43.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是在谈生意  你喜欢永远过苦日子吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm talkin' business. Do you like feelin' hard up?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.35,0:34:44.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你喜欢口袋空空如也的感觉吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you like reachin' in your pocket and only feelin' your leg?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.42,0:34:45.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你喜欢口袋空空如也的感觉吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you like reachin' in your pocket and only feelin' your leg?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.92,0:34:47.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看不是吧 Do you?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.93,0:34:51.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你们最后一次摆脱失败者阴影的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm offering you your last golden opportunity to dump this loser image.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.50,0:34:54.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你以为你是谁?  - 艾莉  你不是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who you talking to? - You ain't working across...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.33,0:34:59.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们两个在搞什么?  这可是大好机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa! What the hell are you talking about? This is a tremendous opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.10,0:35:02.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁的大好机会?  你赚大钱  洛奇残废的机会?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Opportunity for whom? For you to make money? For him to be disabled?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.84,0:35:06.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,换个立场你会怎么做?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would you do if the choices were reversed?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.01,0:35:08.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要好好想一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to think about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.28,0:35:11.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  他们根本不关心你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky,they don't care about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.52,0:35:14.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想听正经话吗?  我就说给你听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to get serious? Let's get serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.12,0:35:18.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是那些希望渺茫者的梦想  他们以你为标竿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You represent the dreams of long shots and little people who identify with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.22,0:35:20.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,认同是成功的关键\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And identification's the key to public success.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.53,0:35:23.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是真正的冠军  人们心中的冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a true champion,a true product of the people. Sell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.19,0:35:26.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁还有人认同时赶快把握  他们不会持久的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sell it while there are still buyers. That won't last forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.43,0:35:27.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是拳击手  那就出赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a fighter? Then fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.93,0:35:29.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要冠军应得的待遇?  那就出赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want a champion's due? Then do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.77,0:35:32.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会让你赚的钱多到可以在里面游泳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll make you so much money,you could swim in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.24,0:35:34.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会游泳吧?  意下如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can swim,can't you,darling? What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.61,0:35:37.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,花点力气赚大钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put it there! It's time to put some hustle behind this muscle!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.71,0:35:40.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他退休了  不再比赛了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's done! He's done fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.32,0:35:50.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是大傻瓜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a damn fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.99,0:35:54.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干脆找你老婆和肯恩比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we oughta sign Mrs. Balboa to fight Cane,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.26,0:35:57.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来她才是真正有卵蛋的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's got the cojones in the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.70,0:36:02.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不准在我老婆面前这么说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't talk like that in front of my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.63,0:36:05.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小鬼  这不是公园板凳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That ain't no park bench,boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.94,0:36:10.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会叫他同意的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.48,0:36:13.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  对不起  我无意...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky,I'm really sorry. I didn't wanna...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.41,0:36:16.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们要私下谈吗?  我会在楼上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys want privacy now? I'll be upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.59,0:36:25.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  对不起  我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. But you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.49,0:36:28.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也知道再挨一记重拳  就可能变成残废\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it just takes one bad hit and you could be an invalid.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.36,0:36:30.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经觉得自己是个残废\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel like an invalid already!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.43,0:36:32.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干嘛要回来?  你不适合这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why'd you come back here? You're too smart for this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.00,0:36:36.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在家没事做  我打电话给葛洛莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got nothing to do. I called Gloria.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.87,0:36:39.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她说需要一个兼职的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She said she could use part-time help.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.77,0:36:43.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么又回到老地方做?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you wanna go back to the same place you started?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.31,0:36:45.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以这么做  你大可不必\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta do it,you don't gotta do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.44,0:36:49.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是为了想跟你接近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted to be there so I could be close to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.36,0:37:01.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  外面有点冷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. It's gettin' cold out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.33,0:37:04.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们进去吧  我了解你的苦心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we better get inside. I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.00,0:37:06.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧?  - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you all right? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.00,0:37:09.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧?  - 我很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you all right? - Yeah,I'm all right. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.73,0:37:12.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,越来越冷了  进去吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gettin' cold,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.84,0:37:22.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉  我们有离开这里吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo,Adrian. Did we ever leave this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.38,0:37:27.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.62,0:37:34.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不介意我和你谈谈吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,mind if I talk to you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.46,0:37:37.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在没心情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My head's a little busy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.87,0:37:51.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道你能否说服他  他脑袋有问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if you'll get him. Balboa don't think straight anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.61,0:37:53.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们全是这样  我需要好理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None of these bums think straight. All I need is an angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.98,0:37:57.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在就找洛奇比赛  我比他厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll fight Balboa right now. I'm better than Balboa ever was.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.72,0:38:01.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小子  你是我的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I own the paper on you,boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.85,0:38:06.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对手  地点  战术  由我决定  明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll fight who,where and how I tell you. Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.86,0:38:11.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别激怒你的老板  懂吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't aggravate the hand that feeds you. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.00,0:38:17.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有一个拳手脑袋是正常的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None of these bums think straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.47,0:38:23.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要的是诱因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I need is a hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.89,0:38:35.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是洛奇的儿子吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,ain't you Rocky's kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.92,0:38:38.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  你是洛奇的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,you're Rocky's kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.29,0:38:40.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是他儿子?  - 我是  你好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're Rocky's kid,right? - Yeah. How you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.36,0:38:42.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在报上见过你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I seen your picture in the paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.56,0:38:44.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你知道吗?  你爸是个杂碎  - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know what? Your old man's a punk! - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.93,0:38:46.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.83,0:38:50.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想怎么样?  你干嘛穿我的外套?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wanna do something about it? What are you wearing my coat for?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.10,0:38:52.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开他  你也想挨揍吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just leave him alone. Don't take his coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.80,0:38:53.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外套给我  我不是开玩笑的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me my coat! I'm not kiddin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.81,0:38:57.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 休想  - 给他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No way! - Let him have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.08,0:39:05.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别生病了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't get sick now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.52,0:39:09.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,富家子  千万别感冒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hope you don't catch cold,rich boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.62,0:39:15.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,左右闪避  出刺拳  就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep it high,slip it inside. That's it. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.19,0:39:18.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇在这里用过的杯子  十元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This cup don't interest you? Rocky drinks out of it. $10.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.90,0:39:22.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我怎么知道是真的?  - 看看唇印吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How I know that's the real thing? - Look at the lip marks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.33,0:39:24.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最多出五元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right,$5. $5,no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.44,0:39:26.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成交\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.44,0:39:28.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.14,0:39:30.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 汤米·甘  - 在哪里换衣服?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tommy Gunn! - Is there someplace I can change?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.17,0:39:31.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面  钱给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In there. Gimme the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.88,0:39:34.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暂停  理查德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time! Richard,good friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.18,0:39:37.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想打赢就得学会出刺拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me. If you wanna survive,you gotta learn to slip the jab.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.68,0:39:42.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动作敏捷点  只打人  不挨打  好  休息一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep it high,and hit and not get hit. Okay,take off.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.02,0:39:44.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 洛奇  还记得汤米甘吧  - 记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rocky,remember Tommy Gunn? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.96,0:39:47.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说要打拳  我叫他去结婚算了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants to fight. I tell him to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.73,0:39:50.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为什么?  - 洛奇  这是本行幽默\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why? - That's gym humor,Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.96,0:39:52.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是那个...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.00,0:39:56.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小子  让我们瞧瞧你的本事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see what you got,kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.33,0:39:58.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结婚  我明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get married. I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.30,0:40:00.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,班森  想活动一下筋骨吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Benson,wanna move a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.67,0:40:02.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好的  - 我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right. - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.24,0:40:05.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么是"卵蛋"?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's a "cojones"?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.71,0:40:08.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卵蛋?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cojones?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.01,0:40:10.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卵蛋是西班牙坚果的拉丁文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cojones is Latin for Spanish nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.41,0:40:12.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  我们准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rock,we're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.82,0:40:14.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.92,0:40:17.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小子  你有带头罩吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,kid. You got headgear?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.95,0:40:20.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有  我不需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need one.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.49,0:40:24.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的卵蛋不保了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gonna get his cojones knocked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.06,0:40:28.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  大伙儿准备好了?  班森  手下留情好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Ready,guys? Benson,go easy,all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.57,0:40:30.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好的  洛奇  - 开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sure,okay,Rocky. - Time.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.84,0:40:36.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  别太猛  出刺拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right,go easy now. Slip the jab now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.51,0:40:39.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小子  他叫什么名字来着?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kid! What's his name again?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.94,0:40:41.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤米·甘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tommy Gunn.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.11,0:40:44.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤米  闪躲并不算错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tommy. Whoa. It ain't no law to duck.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.05,0:40:48.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,左右闪躲  对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go side to side. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.19,0:40:52.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老弟  轻松点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.09,0:40:56.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们两个别这么拼命  这只是练拳  别太激动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,you guys,lighten up. It's called sparring. Go easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.26,0:41:01.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轻一点  班森  抱住他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,lighten up! Benson,tie him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.53,0:41:04.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你闻到没有?  机会的气味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smell that? The odor of opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.27,0:41:07.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够了  我怎么说的?  暂停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it! What'd I tell ya? Hey! Time!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.54,0:41:11.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够了  暂停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,that's it! Time!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.31,0:41:14.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退回去  够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,back off! That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.58,0:41:17.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是怎么回事?  你疯了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter with you? Are you crazy or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.28,0:41:20.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是怎么搞的?  - 出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's the matter with you,man? - Get outta the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.22,0:41:22.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小子  冷静点  我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool off,kid. I'm sorry about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.99,0:41:25.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他很有潜力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He stinks of opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.29,0:41:28.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好  叫你放轻松  不是要你打断别人骨头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look,goin' easy don't mean breakin' bones,kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.76,0:41:30.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很抱歉  你认为如何? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry,but what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.98,0:41:32.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为你根本不听我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do I think? You don't listen good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.96,0:41:36.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你简直像在街头打架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you fight,you brawl like you was a street fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.23,0:41:39.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能体会  但这是拳赛  不是打架滋事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know somethin' about that. This is called boxing. This ain't no mugging.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.67,0:41:42.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起  但我知道我行的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry,but I know I can do it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.34,0:41:45.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天不适合  好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? Well,not on this date. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.14,0:41:46.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就只有这样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.41,0:41:49.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  我要训练这些人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta work with these kids. You guys get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.08,0:41:51.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你当我经纪人好吗?  - 经纪人? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How about you trying to manage me? - Manage?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.95,0:41:55.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  除非你认为我不够看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Unless you think I ain't got nothin' going.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.25,0:41:57.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 不够看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,you got nothin' goin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.89,0:42:00.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有的是本事  资质很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a lot goin'. You got a lot of tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.56,0:42:03.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我不是经纪人  我从没当过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I ain't no manager. I ain't never been...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.46,0:42:06.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这儿的前任老板才是经纪人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The gentleman that owned this place,that was a manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.46,0:42:10.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是被人经纪的家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But me,I was always the managed guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.97,0:42:14.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  祝你好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look,good luck,all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.47,0:42:18.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  各位  开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right,guys,let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.71,0:42:21.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点  左右移动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,move around.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.88,0:42:24.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it,nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.59,0:42:40.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  快点  别乱打  灵活点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right,come on. No cheap shots. Move it around.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.44,0:42:49.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.77,0:42:53.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冷吗?  你好像很冷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cold? You look cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.38,0:42:56.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是天气的关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess it has somethin' to do with the weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.65,0:43:00.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来  穿我的外套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here,take my coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.18,0:43:01.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.95,0:43:04.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你男友在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's your boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.09,0:43:08.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他?  别提了  一点礼貌都不懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Him? Forget it. He ain't got no manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.56,0:43:12.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫茱儿  如果你想知道的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Jewel,if you wanna know.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.93,0:43:15.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫罗伯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Robert.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.64,0:43:21.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我住在这里六年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been livin' here about six years.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.14,0:43:23.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正不是迪士尼乐园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It ain't Disneyland.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.44,0:43:26.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你去过迪士尼乐园?  - 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You been to Disneyland? - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.44,0:43:29.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的口气好像大家都去过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You make it sound like everybody has.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.15,0:43:34.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的外表看不出来  但是我和这里的小孩不同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you can't tell by the way I look,but I ain't like the other kids here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.72,0:43:37.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么你和别人不同?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why? What makes you so different?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.69,0:43:42.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概是我想离开这里的原因吧  你也了解的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. I guess it's 'cause I wanna get out. You know how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.09,0:43:49.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可知道  身为意大利小孩  你的身材还算不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know,for an Italian kid,you ain't got a bad butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.34,0:43:59.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等我一有钱  我就要去迈阿密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First money I get,I'm goin' to Miami.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.94,0:44:03.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为何是迈阿密?  - 迈阿密需要新的牛郎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why Miami? - Miami needs new gigolos.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.15,0:44:06.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  我看过类似报导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,I read somethin' like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.49,0:44:12.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的背又在痛了  你怎么没有关节炎?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My back is gettin' bad. How come you don't have arthritis?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.09,0:44:14.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还不够倒霉吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ain't I got enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.89,0:44:19.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这地方不配艾莉  这里真令人泄气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adrian's too good for this. This place really depresses.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.03,0:44:20.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保罗...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paulie,it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.56,0:44:23.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  进来  大家都在问起你  保罗  你也来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rock,come inside. Everybody's been asking for ya. You too,Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.83,0:44:27.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不  谢谢  我累了  - 我有点口渴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No,thanks. I'm beat. - I'm a little thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.07,0:44:29.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 保罗  你想去就去  - 巴尔博亚先生?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You go if you want,Paulie. - Mr. Balboa?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.11,0:44:31.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你瞧  是汤米·甘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look. Tommy Gunn.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.04,0:44:34.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么还没走?  有什么要我帮忙的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you still hanging around? Is there something I can do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.78,0:44:37.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有  我想再试试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I'd like to try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.72,0:44:42.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很想帮你  可是我不懂经纪 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kid,you know,I'd like to help you,but I know nothin' about no managing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.55,0:44:44.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只要你给我一个机会  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm asking for a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.58,0:44:46.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我搞砸了  我马上就走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I screw up,you won't have to throw me out. I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.86,0:44:51.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你有什么好损失的?  - 没有  损失的是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What have you got to lose? - Me? Nothin'. It's what you got to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.26,0:44:53.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我没什么好损失的  - 或许你有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I got nothin' to lose. - Maybe you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.26,0:44:57.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好  万一我不能胜任  或者你不成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if I don't do good and you don't make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.23,0:44:59.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不希望你为了这个怪我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want you blamin' me for this,kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.94,0:45:02.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  换作是我就会这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's what I would do if I was you. Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.87,0:45:07.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我是你  我会先回家与家人商量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I was you,I would go home and talk to your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.78,0:45:09.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许会有更好的点子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you can come up with something better.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.95,0:45:13.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有家人  我只有孤单一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got no family. All I got is what you see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.48,0:45:17.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你第一次出战阿波罗  我就对你瞭若指掌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know everything about you from your first fight with Apollo Creed.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.45,0:45:20.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也知道没人在乎你或给你机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I read about how nobody cared about you,how no one gave you a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.36,0:45:24.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的出身与你不同  不过我像你一样有斗志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I realize I don't come from the same streets,but I'm hungry like you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.43,0:45:26.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我出道之后就一直想见你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever since I put on gloves,I been waitin' to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.86,0:45:30.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道只有你能让我成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew that if anybody could make me a winner,it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.00,0:45:34.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下  保罗  我算胜利者吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,Paulie,you see a winner standin' here?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.37,0:45:36.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然是  你是高手中的高手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes! Man,you beat the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.14,0:45:40.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人敢否认这一点  洛奇  你不了解我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody could ever say any different. Look,Rocky,you don't know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.08,0:45:42.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要我做什么我都肯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But anything you want me to do,I'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.25,0:45:44.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行的话  我也会卖命去做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I can't,I'll bust my butt trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.88,0:45:48.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是在逼你  我只是要求个机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not hustling you,man. All I'm askin' for is a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.32,0:45:50.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个机会罢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just one shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.63,0:46:02.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你饿了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.27,0:46:05.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.07,0:46:09.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的? 走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.14,0:46:12.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定会喜欢我老婆烧的菜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll like the way Adrian cooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.14,0:46:16.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她煮的通心面美味无比  特别是番茄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She does amazing things with macaroni,especially tomatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.18,0:46:21.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我要警告你  她会放很多大蒜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I gotta warn you,she can be a little vicious with the garlic.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.15,0:46:24.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那小子为何打你的脸?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So,why'd this kid smack your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.82,0:46:30.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没关系的  - 当然有关系  他们抢走他的外套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It really doesn't matter. - It does matter! They took his coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.06,0:46:32.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不要外套  - 有领子的那件?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't want the coat. - The one with the collar?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.46,0:46:35.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我明天要去你学校一趟  - 这会把事情搞得更糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm going to your school. - It'll make things worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.33,0:46:38.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不能做自认正确的事吗?  - 你认为什么是对的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can't I do what I think is right? - What do you think is right?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.77,0:46:40.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿球棒打他的脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A baseball bat across the face is nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.80,0:46:43.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别教坏他好吗?  请把盘子递给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you tellin' this kid? Adrian,can I have the plate?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.24,0:46:46.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 抱歉  洛奇  - 我念书时也遇过这种问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm sorry. Yes,Rocky. - I had trouble when I was in school.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.38,0:46:49.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我每天都被一个小子追\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every day I got chased by this one kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.01,0:46:52.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到我妈妈告诉我:"假装他是气球就好了"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}till one day my mother said,"Pretend the guy's like a balloon."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.78,0:46:54.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,气球?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balloon?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.29,0:46:59.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她说狠狠揍他一顿  他就不敢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She said,"If you pop 'em hard,these guys just go away."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.72,0:47:04.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得教孩子学习用脑处理事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're trying to raise our son so he can handle problems with his mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.86,0:47:06.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而不是暴力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not his muscles.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.66,0:47:07.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.73,0:47:10.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 所以我才被人糟蹋  - 你不会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's why I'm gonna get mangled. - You ain't gonna get mangled.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.90,0:47:14.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你教我打拳好吗?  - 拿球棒就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Will you teach me how to fight? - A baseball bat would be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.57,0:47:17.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想一辈子靠拳头吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you wanna grow up and just use your fists?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.21,0:47:20.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉  我认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adrian,I don't think it'd be so bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.11,0:47:24.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教他几招对付坏蛋  也不是什么坏事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I taught him how to throw a few deadly punches.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.38,0:47:27.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤米  你爸爸也教你打拳吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tommy,did your dad teach you how to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.02,0:47:29.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不尽然  我得...  - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No,not exactly. I had to... - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.35,0:47:31.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别问人隐私  - 没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sweetheart,don't get personal. - That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.42,0:47:34.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸爸经常酗酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My old man used to drink a lot,seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.99,0:47:39.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他与酒肉朋友喝得烂醉  回家后就毒打我一顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'd go out with his friends tie one on,then come home and punch on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.40,0:47:42.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他也打我妈妈  他经常这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'd punch on my mother,too. He did that a lot of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.67,0:47:46.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以长大后我只想打他一顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So growin' up,I never really thought about fighting anybody but my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.74,0:47:49.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我13岁时在学校闯了祸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I was 13,I got in trouble at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.81,0:47:53.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他把我绑起来  狠狠抽我一顿  我一周都不能走路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He tied me down and whipped me so bad,I couldn't walk for a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.54,0:47:55.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事都不能做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just couldn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.51,0:47:58.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我第一个击倒的人是我爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first guy I ever knocked out was my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.35,0:48:02.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次出场就把对手当成他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now when I get in the ring,it's like all I see is him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.12,0:48:04.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有点变态吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's kinda sick,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.89,0:48:10.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少你还有对象可以打  不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tommy,at least you had an old man to knock out.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.93,0:48:18.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 有些人根本没有  - 有一天你也会揍你老爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Some of us didn't have that. - Someday you can punch out your pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.47,0:48:21.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保罗 你干嘛教坏小孩子?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paulie,what are you tellin' the kid things like this for?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.47,0:48:24.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,适者生存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the fittest of the survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.11,0:48:26.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你今晚住哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tommy,where you stayin' tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.54,0:48:30.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 有地方睡吗?  - 我会找到地方睡的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You got a place? - I'll find someplace to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.05,0:48:34.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样好了  地下室还有个房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tell you,we got room in the basement. It's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.12,0:48:37.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那我呢?  - 那是你儿子的房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What about me? - Your son is sleeping down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.76,0:48:41.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他可以和叔叔一起睡  - 我算什么  救济站吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He could stay with his uncle. - What am I,a pit stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.23,0:48:44.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想造成各位不便  我找别的地方睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't wanna cause any problems. I can find someplace to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.59,0:48:49.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系  反正只是暂时的  对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay. It's just for a little while. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.43,0:48:51.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No problem at all. It'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.80,0:48:53.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子  我很感激你  外面很冷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kid,I appreciate it. Is that all right? It's cold outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.84,0:48:58.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我可不换床单  - 你何时换过了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm not changing no sheets. - Since when have you ever?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.51,0:49:02.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤米  你来看一下房间吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tommy,come on down and we'll show you the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.08,0:49:07.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下去让你爸看看你今天的成果  快去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you go downstairs,show your father what you did today? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.09,0:49:14.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子  你不会尿床吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Junior,your plumbin' don't leak,do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.57,0:49:25.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你认识他?  - 认识 他出拳很猛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know this guy? - Yeah. He hits hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.74,0:49:30.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 艾莉的菜烧得真好  - 对  很好吃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Adrian,she can really cook. - She's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.81,0:49:34.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  我们没时间整理地下室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen,Tommy. We ain't had a chance to get this place too nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.04,0:49:37.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等下大伙儿一起收拾一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so we'll get it together in a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.75,0:49:40.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这才是拳击手的目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow,man. This is what it's all about!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.52,0:49:43.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我的天  - 为何全放在地下室?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Holy mackerel! - Why do you keep this stuff down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.99,0:49:48.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你何时整理的?  你把所有东西都排好了  太美了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When'd you do this? You fixed it like this. It's beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.23,0:49:51.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还上了油漆  你何时整理的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You painted! When'd you get a chance to do this,kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.33,0:49:53.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放学后  这没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After school. It's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.90,0:49:56.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 拳套是哪里来的?  - 这个吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where'd you get the glove? - This?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.97,0:49:59.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢  这是我最心爱的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks. This is one of my favorite objects.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.84,0:50:02.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米克在他过世之前送给我的 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mickey give me this before he departed.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.64,0:50:05.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 它是洛奇·马西安诺的袖扣  - 真的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It was Rocky Marciano's cuff link. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.01,0:50:07.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 真的?  洛奇·马西安诺?  - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The real Rocky Marciano? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.41,0:50:10.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你令我又想起米克  我有样东西给你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got me thinkin' about Mickey. I wanna show you somethin'. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.35,0:50:14.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他很久以前告诉我的  他说...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He told me a long time ago,he says...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.95,0:50:19.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳击是九成的智慧  再加上一成的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that fightin' is 90% in the skull and 10% in the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.16,0:50:20.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said this.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.66,0:50:23.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸  我今天认识一个很棒的女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I met this really nice girl today. She's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.29,0:50:27.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 真的?  太好了  - 她比莎菈漂亮多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah? That's wonderful. - She's a lot better than Sarah.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.93,0:50:30.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子  别换话题  待会再和你聊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't change the station. I'll be right back with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.47,0:50:32.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先和汤米聊聊 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wanna tell Tommy a few things.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.50,0:50:35.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在奥兰多最好的朋友是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who was your best friend in Orlando?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.17,0:50:37.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是俄克拉荷马州\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh,that's Oklahoma.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.94,0:50:40.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对  没错  - 艾瑞克·爱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh,yeah. - Eric Elder.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.48,0:50:44.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不对  你最好的朋友是法兰克·恐惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,no,no. Your best friend is a guy named Frankie Fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.01,0:50:47.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐惧是拳手最好的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see,fear is a fighter's best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.15,0:50:49.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用不着不好意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It ain't nothin' to be ashamed of.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.72,0:50:53.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐惧令你保持警觉  令你清醒  令你有生存的意志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fear keeps you sharp,keeps you awake,makes you wanna survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.56,0:50:57.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但重点是你得学习控制它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Know what I mean? But you gotta learn how to control it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.49,0:51:01.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为恐惧就像一把火  在内心深处燃烧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause fear is like this fire. And it's burnin' deep inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.53,0:51:04.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要详加控制  就能使你振奋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you control it,Tommy,it's gonna make you hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.70,0:51:07.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果让它控制了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you see,if this thing here controls you...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.67,0:51:11.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的一切就会化为灰烬 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's gonna burn you and everything else around you up,that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.94,0:51:15.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之  这些是恩师教给我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway,these are the things that was taught to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.35,0:51:18.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你愿意的话  我就传授给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and if you want,I'd like to teach to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.98,0:51:21.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这表示你要当我的经纪人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this mean you're gonna manage me?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.69,0:51:24.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 当然  家族队  - 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Absolutely! Hey,home team! - All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.72,0:51:26.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.49,0:51:28.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要先示范几招?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mind showing me a few things?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.56,0:51:31.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然  我要教的事太多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure. I'm gonna show you a lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.32,0:51:39.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,富家子  你今天带了多少钱?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,rich boy,how much you got in your pocket today?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.45,0:51:41.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没有钱  - 快拿出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nothin'. - Let's have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.45,0:51:44.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没有  我身上没钱  - 快拿出来给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I got nothin'! - Come on,give me the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.19,0:51:46.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快点  - 我要买午餐的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on! - I gotta eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.89,0:51:50.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他饿了  要吃东西  吃拳头吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's hungry! He's gotta eat. Well,eat this.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.97,0:51:55.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我拿到了  快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.30,0:51:57.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡敏神父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father Carmine!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.27,0:52:00.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡敏神父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo! Father Carmine!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.34,0:52:03.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 也许他不在家  - 神父一向都在家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe he's not home. - Priests is always home.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.28,0:52:05.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.28,0:52:11.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神父  我不想太打扰你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't wanna disturb you that much,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.69,0:52:16.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常好  一切都很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excellent. Everything is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.63,0:52:19.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神父  这是我的新朋友汤米·甘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father,this is my new friend,Tommy Gunn.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.80,0:52:28.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤米是拳手  我准备当他经纪人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was wondering,Tommy is a fighter and I'm supposed to be his manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.40,0:52:31.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你不忙的话  帮我一个忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I was wondering if you could do me a favor if you ain't busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.54,0:52:33.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你替我们赐福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you could throw us down a couple of blessings...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.94,0:52:36.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一  我会是个称职的经纪人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like that I don't mess up being the manager...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.95,0:52:41.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二  他能像我所想的那么棒  不会受伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that Tommy does as good as I think he can do,great,and don't get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.38,0:52:44.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.80,0:52:55.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就喜欢他这么做  神父  谢谢你  感激不尽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love when he does that. Thanks,Father. I appreciate this.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.60,0:52:57.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.24,0:52:59.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教堂见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you in church.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.87,0:53:03.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干嘛这么做?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'd you do this for?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.88,0:53:06.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有神明保佑总是好事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It don't hurt havin' an angel in your corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.45,0:53:08.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.38,0:53:14.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 洛奇  近来可好?  - 好的很\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey,Rock,how's it goin'? - Doin' great!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.45,0:53:16.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢一点  免得开罚单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slow down,we'll give you a ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.46,0:53:20.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他是汤米甘  未来的拳王  - 你好吗?  汤米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is Tommy Gunn. He'll be champion. - How you doin',Tom?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.85,0:53:33.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,散开  别打了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Break it up. Break it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.53,0:53:47.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别靠近绳子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get off the ropes!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.20,0:53:56.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 放轻松点  懂吗?  - 我得多练习\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go easy,all right? - I need more work.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.20,0:54:02.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不必 你已经准备好了  - 我得多练习  他太厉害了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No,you're ready. - This guy's killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.44,0:54:03.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很完美  明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're perfect. You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.64,0:54:06.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我没胜算  - 闭嘴 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I feel weak. - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.05,0:54:10.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄与懦夫间的唯一的差别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only difference between the hero and a coward...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.58,0:54:13.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是英雄勇往直前不畏生死 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is the hero's willing to go for it,willing to take the shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.19,0:54:16.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这小子也一样害怕  你们都害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This guy's scared,too. You're both scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.36,0:54:20.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得我们曾谈论过畏惧 还有燃烧内心的火?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember we were talking about fear and how it was like this fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.08,0:54:23.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要学习控制  因为不是烧死你就是烧死他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta control it 'cause it'll burn you up or burn him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.23,0:54:27.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要善加利用  我不会做伤害你的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta make it work for you. I would never do nothin' to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.14,0:54:29.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白我说什么吗?  畏惧就像这团火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understand what I'm sayin'. Fear is like this fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.47,0:54:34.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让它燃烧直到火山爆发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let it burn until it becomes like this volcano.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.18,0:54:36.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时机成熟时  看准空隙  全部爆发在他身上 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when the time is right,explode all over this guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.91,0:54:39.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能制伏他  全靠你的心智\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can take him. It's all heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.92,0:54:43.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不在于硬拼  心智与火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It ain't all muscle. It's all heart and fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.09,0:54:46.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去击败他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.29,0:54:50.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记住  我就像你肩上的天使保佑你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember,I'm like this angel sitting on your shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.10,0:54:53.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会让你出事的 懂吗?  上吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't gonna let nothin' happen to you. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.67,0:55:04.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油  汤米  出刺拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,jab!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.18,0:55:07.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,左拳  右拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Explode! Left,right!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.82,0:55:10.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打身体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The body!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.25,0:55:12.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.92,0:56:14.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打身体  汤米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to the body!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.09,0:56:15.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.99,0:56:18.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man,you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.04,0:56:22.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤米·甘  威力像把枪  对不对?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tommy Gunn,you got some guns!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.25,0:56:42.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加把劲  35下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drive through it. Thirty-five.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.39,0:56:56.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十下  你办得到的  对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten. Come on,you can do it. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.93,0:57:00.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油  撑起来  太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got it! Bring it up! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.78,0:57:03.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我赢了  这次我赢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotcha! I gotcha this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.46,0:57:17.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤米  这些拳击短裤意义重大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tommy,these trunks is very special to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.81,0:57:31.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小子  打得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kid,that was great! Great work!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.82,0:57:45.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right,kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.16,0:57:57.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我赢了  真不敢相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I beat the man! I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.84,0:58:00.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确实做到了  汤米  你身手敏捷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure did. You're very swift.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.04,0:58:14.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梅林  听好  我有主意了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merlin,listen. Got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.88,0:58:16.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我终于有办法逼洛奇出赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we can finally nail Balboa.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.02,0:58:21.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们又在等你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're waitin' again.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.29,0:58:23.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你钱不够  我身上有一元 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't got enough money,I've got almost a dollar.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.49,0:58:25.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 留着吧  - 又在躲我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Save it. - Slumming again,bimbo?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.96,0:58:29.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 背包里有什么?  - 闭嘴 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What you got in the bag? - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.33,0:58:32.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你再走我就打得你满地找牙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take two more steps,I'm gonna pound your teeth out.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.73,0:58:34.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,试试看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.20,0:58:37.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说什么?  这小子脑子有毛病 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'd he say? Punk's losin' his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.36,0:58:39.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你说什么?  - 试试看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What'd you say? - Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.53,0:59:00.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点  过来跟我打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Put up your hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.40,0:59:03.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  反正我也不喜欢他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No way! I didn't like him anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.17,0:59:09.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外套是我的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think that belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.14,0:59:14.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你愿意的话  现在就一笔勾销\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you want to end it,let's end it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.35,0:59:17.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没意见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got no problem with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.58,0:59:20.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回头见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.52,0:59:25.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我真不敢相信  - 你会告诉你爸爸吗? 走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't believe it. - You gonna tell your dad? Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.33,0:59:29.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  就是这样  再来一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good,that's it. One more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.86,0:59:33.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你出拳很猛  不过得多练习闪躲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tommy,you're doing great with the combinations.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.93,0:59:36.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你得学会像汽车挡风玻璃上的刮水器一样移动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you gotta learn to move side to side like a windshield wiper...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.10,0:59:38.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脸上才不会吃拳头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so you ain't gettin' kicked in the face with the jab.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.74,0:59:43.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸  我把外套要回来了 你看  我的外套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad! I got my coat back! Look,I got my coat!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.32,0:59:46.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子  太棒了  了不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's great! That's beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.82,0:59:50.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我击败那小子  同学为之疯狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I trashed this guy! Everybody in the school went crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.48,0:59:53.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 洛奇  我的拳击感快没了  - 听着  我要和汤米练拳了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rocky,I'm coolin' down. - I gotta get back with Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.43,0:59:56.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要努力  他正在平静下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta work out. He's coolin' down.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.29,0:59:59.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉你妈  她一定喜欢听的  棒极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go tell your mom. She likes to hear things like that. That's beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.56,1:00:02.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤米  我们开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Let's go,Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.77,1:00:04.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lookin' good.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.31,1:00:07.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快看汤米的厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa! Look at Tommy go.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.11,1:00:18.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯恩  新科重量级拳王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Union Cane,the new heavyweight championof the world!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.15,1:00:23.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你想我有机会吗?  - 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Think I have a chance at that? - Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.22,1:00:26.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤米 只要有一双拳头 加上一颗好心脏 人人都有机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anybody that's got two fists and a good heartbeat,you got a chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.81,1:00:37.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你输了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're out!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.30,1:00:53.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强硬起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Get tough!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.60,1:01:07.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的黄金手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boy,you've got hands of gold!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.78,1:01:09.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来一下  我介绍个人给你认识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to introduce you to somebody. Karen,come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.81,1:02:10.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比赛结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it! It's over!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.25,1:02:20.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤米  击倒他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back him up.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.64,1:02:27.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比赛结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.52,1:02:29.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那是你的船  - 什么船? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's your boat. - What boat?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.44,1:02:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快沉没的那艘船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The one that's sinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.34,1:02:50.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一把交椅的汤米·甘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tommy Gunn at the top.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.51,1:02:53.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要你为杜克打拳...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You come with the Duke...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.38,1:02:57.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,包你荣华富贵  洛奇只能干瞪眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can get the kind of payday fighters for Balboa can only dream about.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.93,1:02:59.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胜利者享有一切战利品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the victor goes the spoils.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.41,1:03:11.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤米  出刺拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lift the jab!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.71,1:03:19.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你输了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're out!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.81,1:03:23.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你赢了 成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did it,man!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.89,1:03:28.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我现在可以争拳王了吧?  - 很快就可以了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now will I get a shot at the title? - You're gonna get one real soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.39,1:03:30.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宝贝  你还好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baby,how are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.32,1:03:33.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤米只花二分十秒赢得胜利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The winner at two minutes,ten seconds...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.33,1:03:38.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 汤米何时挑战肯恩?  - 这件事得从长计议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- When's Tommy goin' up against Cane? - We gotta talk about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.50,1:03:40.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去访问别人  好吗?  洛奇  他不值得的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back. He ain't worth it,buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.60,1:03:42.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他打得很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He fought a great fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.52,1:03:47.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的船沉了  洛奇  没希望了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ship is sunk,Rocky. It's sunk.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.89,1:04:05.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他可能塞车了  否则早该到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably got hung up in traffic. He should've been here by now.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.39,1:04:05.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.99,1:04:09.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在是圣诞节  他应该陪家人一起过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Christmas. He should be with his family.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.00,1:04:11.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许他不认为我们是他的家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe he doesn't think this is his family.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.77,1:04:16.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然是  艾莉  你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure it is. Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.44,1:04:20.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要送他这个  你认为如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to give this to him. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.48,1:04:22.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你给他的已经够多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you've given enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.05,1:04:27.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得了  艾莉  他也给了我们不少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,Adrian. He's given us things too.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.72,1:04:30.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他让我们东山再起  不是吗?  别这样  今天是圣诞节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's given us like a second shot,right? Come on. It's Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.45,1:04:35.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错  只有在美国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. Only in America.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.09,1:04:39.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才能得到最好的享受  想保有这一切就得永远领先\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Having the best,wearing the best. To keep it up,you got to stay on top.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.62,1:04:42.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没有人会记得亚军的  - 我就不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nobody remembers number two,kid. - I sure don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.67,1:04:44.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我查过拳击协会的资料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I checked with the Boxing Commission.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.01,1:04:49.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和洛奇没有正式的合约关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seems there's no formal contract between you and Balboa.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.33,1:04:52.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有  只是君子协定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothin'.Just a handshake.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.68,1:04:54.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳击这一行很复杂  你得时时保持警觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a complex business,and you've got to stay sharp!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.31,1:04:57.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用不着我多说  对不对?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have to tell you that,do I?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.32,1:05:01.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长期活在洛奇的阴影下 一定很不好受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gotta be damn difficult living in Rocky's shadow,being called his puppet.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.25,1:05:02.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人能像你忍受这么久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody could've done it as long as you have.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.86,1:05:04.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.53,1:05:07.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你再这样下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid that if you keep going the way you're going...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.93,1:05:11.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就会错过大好机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're gonna be watching the parade go by.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.50,1:05:14.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一点不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.20,1:05:18.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还没享受真正的光荣  你也不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You haven't had the big payday yet,and won't until you fight top contenders.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.00,1:05:20.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非你挑战真正的一流拳手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And those top contenders I do surely own.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.01,1:05:22.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有一份合约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got the contracts.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.31,1:05:25.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个复杂的行业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a complex business.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.61,1:05:27.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你想得到最好的就要跟对人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you want the best,then go with the best.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.38,1:05:30.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about Rocky?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.32,1:05:33.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇还是可以训练你  他表现得很棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky can still train you. He's done a wonderful job.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.02,1:05:36.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是二万元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's $20,000.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.19,1:05:38.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就当作是定金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it as an advance.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.23,1:05:40.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也该好好享受一番了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to put some hustle behind this muscle.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.96,1:05:43.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.10,1:05:46.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.14,1:05:53.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大消息  你们一定不相信谁在屋顶上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop the press! You can't believe who just come up on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.18,1:05:56.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他才刚刚抵达  你们猜他是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He just landed there and crashed. Who do you think it is?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.24,1:05:59.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是驯鹿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I hear reindeer on my roof?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.09,1:06:03.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,驯鹿角  真难以置信  有一大群\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know,antlers! It's unbelievable! Like a billion...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.36,1:06:05.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快来  看看谁来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa! Look who's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.96,1:06:07.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都认识他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know this guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.63,1:06:10.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你家人真怪异  - 难道我不知道?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You've got a weird family. - Don't I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.13,1:06:13.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等他再下来就是明年圣诞节了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna be next Christmas before he gets down.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.23,1:06:15.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家为圣诞老公公鼓掌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's put it together for Santa!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.30,1:06:17.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐! 哟...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas. Yo,yo,yo.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.51,1:06:23.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圣诞老公公  你说错了 应该是哈...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think you got it right,Santa. It's,"Ho,ho,ho."
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.64,1:06:26.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么不同? 我家乡都是哟...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the freakin' difference? Where I come from it's yo,yo,yo.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.61,1:06:28.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来圣诞老公公喝醉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like we've got a 90-proof Santa.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.45,1:06:29.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圣诞老公公\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Santa...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.62,1:06:35.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉孩子们你从北极带来什么礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}tell the kids what you've got in the bag you brought from the North.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.71,1:06:37.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我带了一包要洗的衣服  - 你拿错包包了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I've got my laundry. - You got the wrong bag.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.19,1:06:40.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 胖子  别挡路  - 小心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on,chubby,get out of the way. - Watch it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.83,1:06:44.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让圣诞老公公坐一下  过来  小子  你乖不乖?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let Santa take a seat. Little boy,you been nice?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.63,1:06:49.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 来  坐下  - 你何不告诉圣诞老公公要什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come here. Sit down. - Tell Santa what you need.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.36,1:06:50.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他拉我衣服  我什么都不需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're stretching the clothes! I don't need nothin'!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.01,1:06:53.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉他你真正想要什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell Santa what you really want.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.81,1:06:56.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是圣诞老公公  是保罗叔  别骗人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That ain't Santa! It's Uncle Paulie. Get real.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.71,1:07:00.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别骗人了是什么意思?  你干嘛这样说话?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Get real"? Why you talkin' like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.98,1:07:04.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只是想快乐一下  圣诞老公公也在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're trying to have a good time. Santa's here and everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.19,1:07:06.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太蠢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's stupid!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.66,1:07:13.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一点也不蠢  大家只是假装一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It ain't stupid. We're just trying to pretend here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.36,1:07:16.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本来就是该假装一下  好像玩游戏一样  你懂吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're supposed to be pretending. It's like this game,right?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.97,1:07:19.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不喜欢假装 你们去和圣诞老公公说话算了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like pretending. You guys talk to Santa.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.07,1:07:23.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是和他们谈  我是要和你谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't talkin' to them,I'm talkin' with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.64,1:07:27.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与家人和乐融融是很重要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See,it's very important that you spend time with the family...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.15,1:07:28.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要让这个精神代代相传\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and have a good time and get the spirit goin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.51,1:07:31.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是好事  明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's good,right?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.88,1:07:35.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么好的?  我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good for what? Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.39,1:07:36.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他朋友在场 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His friends are here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.66,1:07:39.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他是无心的  - 我知道他想要什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He doesn't want to. - I know what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.76,1:07:42.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你哪会知道我想要什么?  - 因为我了解你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How do you know what I want? - 'Cause I know you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.87,1:07:44.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你了解我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know me?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.23,1:07:47.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他自以为了解我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He thinks he knows me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.43,1:07:50.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不要过圣诞节  好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't celebratin' nothing,okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.17,1:07:53.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here. What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.07,1:07:54.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们以前都是这样过  一直都很快乐  艾莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We always done this before,we had a good time.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.18,1:07:57.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不必改变什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have to change nothin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.21,1:08:03.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还记得去年我们玩得多快乐?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you remember last year when we had fun,we had a good time?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.79,1:08:09.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是去年  你也不一样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It ain't last year,and you ain't the same,either.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.46,1:08:14.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.13,1:08:16.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉  我做错什么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adrian,what'd I do?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.58,1:08:18.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去和他谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.17,1:08:23.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我早料到会发生此事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even I could've saw this thing happening.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.64,1:08:26.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当初早该去迈阿密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should've went to Miami when I had the chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.01,1:08:28.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想谈?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna talk?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.28,1:08:31.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就谈吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.59,1:08:37.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为我们父子情深\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought we were supposed to be like very close.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.49,1:08:40.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我爱你  - 不 你不爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I love you. - No,you don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.26,1:08:43.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当然爱你  你还记得吗 Sure\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do. Remember what the deal was?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.16,1:08:48.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们应该像手指一样紧紧在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We was supposed to be tight,like crossed fingers.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.13,1:08:51.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只想和汤米紧紧在一起  这才是你真正的意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. You want you and Tommy to be tight. That's what you're takin' about.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.80,1:08:53.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别这么说  - 为什么不行?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't say that. - Why can't I say it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.07,1:08:55.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你总是汤米长  汤米短的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since he's been here,it's "Tommy this,Tommy that."
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.98,1:08:58.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不给我时间  我也没时间陪你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have no time for nobody,so I got no time for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.48,1:09:01.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么?  你好像另外一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you saying? You're like another person.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.71,1:09:03.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你才是另外一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the other person!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.55,1:09:06.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说我是你心目中第一人  你骗人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said I would be number one to you. You lied!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.32,1:09:08.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你骗了我  也骗了妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lied to me and to Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.49,1:09:13.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从没骗你  汤米需要我帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never lied to you. Tommy needed my help.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.73,1:09:15.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So did I.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.80,1:09:18.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得你告诉我  要小心被人欺骗吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember when you said to watch out for scams and deceptions?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.30,1:09:20.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.21,1:09:23.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你才是该小心的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the one that should've watched out.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.21,1:09:31.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你要去哪里?  - 出去走走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where you going? - Out.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.98,1:09:34.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么时候回来?  - 晚一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- When you coming back? - Later.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.95,1:09:37.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底几点?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.66,1:09:44.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇太太  佳节愉快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Season's greetings,Mrs. Balboa!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.03,1:09:47.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去打发他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take care of these people.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.60,1:09:53.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快看  有位圣诞老公公\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behold! A Santa for all seasons!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.70,1:09:55.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们迷路了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys lost?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.48,1:09:58.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正好相反  我是专程拜访\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Au contraire,mon ami. I know exactly where I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.21,1:10:03.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  猜猜看是谁来晚餐了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky,guess what's comin' to dinner!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.45,1:10:04.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤米·甘交了新朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tommy Gunn's got new friends!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.68,1:10:07.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新的一年  新的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New friends for a new year!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.19,1:10:12.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这算什么? 保罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paulie, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.56,1:10:15.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好美的圣诞树  真漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice tree. Charming.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.43,1:10:16.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤米  你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tommy,how you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.60,1:10:19.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐  阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas,milord! Greetings!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.90,1:10:23.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你好吗?  - 听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How you doin'? - Listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.17,1:10:25.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想打扰太长时间  只是来祝你圣诞快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to take up time. I just wanted to give a season's greetings.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.34,1:10:28.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不需要礼物  - 那就送给邻居\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't need no presents. - Give 'em to the neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.34,1:10:31.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把他训练得很棒  这是不争的事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've done a hell of a job with the man. Facts are facts.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.68,1:10:34.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果看不出他有冠军相  那我不就成了瞎子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd have to be blind if I didn't say a title shot isn't in the cards.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.95,1:10:37.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 冠军相?  - 我们合作是天衣无缝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Title shot? - We'll work beautifully together.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.38,1:10:39.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No problems.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.19,1:10:43.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有摩擦  只有和谐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No friction. Only harmony.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.13,1:10:46.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该是让他好好表现的时候了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time to put some hustle behind this muscle.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.40,1:10:50.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤米有些事要和你讨论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tommy boy here has got a little something personal to discuss with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.60,1:10:52.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先告辞了  圣诞快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I'm gonna be sayin' good night. Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.20,1:10:54.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.90,1:10:57.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 回头见  - 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- See you soon. - Bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.81,1:11:00.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉我来晚了  晚餐耽误了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry I'm late. I ended up having dinner.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.28,1:11:03.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系  汤米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay,Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.11,1:11:05.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉烧了些好菜  大概凉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adrian cooked something,but it's probably all cold now.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.78,1:11:09.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不如再做些三明治\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can always make sandwiches.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.22,1:11:14.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想做三明治  你干嘛带他来这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to make sandwiches. Tommy,why did you bring him here?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.83,1:11:17.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他只是想问候一声  不介意我们到外面聊一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wanted to come by. Rocky,could I talk to you outside about some things?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.63,1:11:20.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.33,1:11:23.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很晚了  我们十点以前要赶到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's getting late. We have to be there by 10:00.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.33,1:11:26.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 洛奇?  - 不  没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rocky? - I know. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.64,1:11:32.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要跟我谈什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tommy,what'd you want to talk to me about?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.68,1:11:34.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 车程不是很远吗?  - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Isn't it a long drive? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.58,1:11:37.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So,what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.05,1:11:41.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你从哪弄来的?  - 杜克送我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where'd you get this? - Duke gave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.32,1:11:44.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许你该把车子还给他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you ought to give this thing back,you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.32,1:11:46.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就知道你会这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew it! I knew you would say that!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.23,1:11:49.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还给他?  为什么?  他欣赏我的拳击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give it back? Why? The guy likes the way I fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.30,1:11:51.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快十点了  - 好  我们赶得上的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's almost 10:00. - We'll make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.60,1:11:55.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤米  你还不明白他的用意吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know,but you see what he's doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.64,1:11:57.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别中了他的离间之计  我们才是好搭档\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let him put nothin' between us.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.41,1:12:01.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他只是要栽培我争夺拳王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put what? The guy was talkin' about gettin' a shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.74,1:12:04.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不需要他 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we don't need him.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.21,1:12:07.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会有机会的  到时候这玩意儿买十部都行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna get a shot. You'll be able to buy ten of these things.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.58,1:12:11.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你何时才会清醒?  我们眼睁睁错失良机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When are you gonna wake up? We're watchin' the parade go by.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.32,1:12:15.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么机会?  - 天大的好机会 - Look.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talkin' about? - The big time.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.76,1:12:16.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,照现在这样子  我会很久都没有机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The way I'm goin',I won't get a shot at the title for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.83,1:12:18.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的纪录这么好  22场全胜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got a perfect record. I'm 22 and 0.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.89,1:12:21.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,钱在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the money? Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.40,1:12:24.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们什么大钱都没赚到  没有他也别想办到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We haven't made serious money yet,and we won't without the man.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.90,1:12:28.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我指的不是钱  钱自然会赚到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't talkin' about the money. The money is gonna be there.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.24,1:12:32.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我指的是你的名声  不要签卖身契  我们不需要他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm talking about your rep,Tommy. Don't sell out. We don't need this guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.21,1:12:35.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杜克是个好人  把车顶拉上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen. Duke is a wonderful man. Put the top up.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.71,1:12:38.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别管车顶的事  我明天和他签约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget about the top! I'm signing papers with the man tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.72,1:12:41.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你签下合约就是他的财产了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sign them papers,you're like his property.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.89,1:12:44.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会失去自由  这是卑鄙的交易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got no control. This is a dirty business.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.49,1:12:47.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全是些土匪流氓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's full of these thieves and gangsters.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.16,1:12:51.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们假装承诺一大堆好处  骗取年轻拳手的信任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They promise the world to every good young fighter who comes along.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.86,1:12:54.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后再榨干他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They suck 'em dry.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.97,1:12:58.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等没有利用价值时就甩掉他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They leave 'em in the gutter broke when they ain't worth nothin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.14,1:13:01.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一行就是这么回事  杜克这种人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the way this business is run. Guys like Duke...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.27,1:13:06.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道他是什么吗?  他是个吸血鬼  靠你的血汗满足自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what he is? He's a vampire. He's living off your blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.34,1:13:09.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对你的方式正是米克对我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The thing I'm trying to do is what Mick done to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.45,1:13:14.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他让我尽量远离卑鄙的交易  正是我要为你做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He tried to keep me away from the dirty part of the business,like I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.26,1:13:18.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是你  你也不是米克  你何时才会明白?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't you,and you ain't Mick! When you gonna understand that?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.09,1:13:20.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是做生意  你需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you gonna understand this is a business? And you need...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.73,1:13:22.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么? 头脑吗?   - 是你说的  不是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Brains? - You said that,not me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.76,1:13:25.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说我没脑子吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sayin' I got no brains?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.87,1:13:28.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你带我进拳坛  但杜克给我争拳王的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You took me as far as you could,but Duke gave me a title shot,you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.57,1:13:31.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果想继续训练我  可以  不想的话就算了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you want to keep training me,do it. If you don't,don't!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.29,1:13:34.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但要照我的方式  不然就拉倒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's my way or the highway!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.26,1:13:50.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿上外套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put on your coat.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.16,1:13:52.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么做不值得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. It's not worth it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.16,1:13:54.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,值得  他只是迷失方向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is worth it. He's just confused.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.06,1:13:57.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你没认清现实  - 我看得很清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You don't see what's happening. - I do see!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.27,1:14:00.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他被杜克耍得团团转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's twisted around by Duke.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.17,1:14:03.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  是你  不是他 你不能越活越回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's you,it's not him. You can't live backwards.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.11,1:14:05.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你无法令时光倒流  我们是活在此时此地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't turn back the clock. We live now,we live here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.78,1:14:09.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当然知道  你以为我是笨蛋?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know where we live! You think I'm stupid?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.28,1:14:12.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不像你想像中那么笨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not as dumb as you think I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.28,1:14:15.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为我不明白吗?  我知道我们的处境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't think I can smell it? I see where we are!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.45,1:14:18.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要过这种日子  我要家人过好日子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want this no more. I want something different for the family.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.42,1:14:22.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want this!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.29,1:14:26.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来这里可不是让别人耻笑的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I come back here and get my brains beat out for these guys to say...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.66,1:14:29.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇只是一个蹩脚货而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"There goes Balboa.Just another bum in the neighborhood"?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.87,1:14:34.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不要这样  - 不  别这样  没人这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I didn't want this. - No,nobody said that.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.14,1:14:37.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我说的  艾莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sayin' this,Adrian.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.11,1:14:39.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每当那小子出场比赛  我就感觉赢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When that kid was in the ring,I was winning.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.75,1:14:43.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他赢就等于我赢了  - 你赢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- When he was winning,I was winning. - You were winning?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.12,1:14:48.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我赢得尊敬的最后机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was like my last chance to get some respect for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.39,1:14:50.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好了  我尊敬你  - 你不能尊敬我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I respect you! - You can't respect me!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.79,1:14:52.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不  你做不到  - 我可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No,you can't! - I do!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.93,1:14:55.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你比赛时所受的伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All those beatings you took in the ring...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.36,1:14:58.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是感同身受  我知道你的感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took them with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.67,1:15:02.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道像汤米这种人一出现  你又恢复生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know how you feel. When somebody like Tommy comes along,you feel alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.90,1:15:05.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他不是你  他没有你的意志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he's not you. He doesn't have your heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.81,1:15:11.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有你击败的对手  你是用意志击败他们  不是蛮力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All those fighters you beat,you beat 'em with heart,not muscle.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.11,1:15:13.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米克知道这点  你和米克才显得特别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what Mickey knew. That's why you and Mickey were special.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.68,1:15:16.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是米克已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Mickey's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.35,1:15:21.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你想传承  应该传给你儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there's something you want to pass on,pass it on to your son.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.83,1:15:24.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看在老天分上  你儿子已经迷失  他需要你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For God's sake! Your son is lost! He needs you!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.46,1:15:28.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道汤米令你感觉很棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know Tommy makes you feel great.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.47,1:15:32.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他让你觉得又要赢得胜利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He makes you feel like you're winning again.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.90,1:15:34.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你却输掉家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're losing us!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.08,1:15:39.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  你要失去家人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're losing your family!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.68,1:15:47.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.09,1:15:51.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有你了解我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was always you and me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.30,1:15:56.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉  对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry,Adrian.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.57,1:16:00.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道你们怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know about you guys...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.57,1:16:04.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可要离开这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I gotta get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.07,1:16:09.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们去海边  好吗?  - 好  我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you say we go to the shore? - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.08,1:16:10.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了  我们要怎么去?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. How we gonna get there?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.95,1:16:14.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么去?  伸大拇指搭便车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean? We throw our thumbs in the air. We'll hitchhike.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.12,1:16:16.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah,what's he want?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.85,1:16:20.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 要我陪你吗?  - 不用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You want me to stay with you? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.49,1:16:24.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我老爸已经够烦了  走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got enough problems with my old man. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.20,1:16:28.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你不会打他吧?  - 不  我不会打他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You ain't gonna hit him,are you? - No,I ain't gonna hit him.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.20,1:16:32.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子  你何时开始学抽烟?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo,kid,when you start smokin'?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.24,1:16:34.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道  你没抽过烟吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Didn't you ever smoke?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.27,1:16:39.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有  你可知我做过不少坏事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I done a lot of bad things,you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.38,1:16:41.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那又怎样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.01,1:16:44.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我后来学乖了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So,I wised up.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.95,1:16:48.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的  也许有一天我也会学乖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So maybe I'll wise up someday,too.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.99,1:16:54.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许今晚是我们俩学乖的好机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe tonight's a good night for both of us to start wising up.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.16,1:16:55.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你放心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.06,1:17:00.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当然会担心 我们应该是很亲近的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta worry about it. The deal was we were supposed to be tight,right?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.44,1:17:06.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤米呢?  你不是跟他很亲近?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about Tommy? You're tight with him,too.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.14,1:17:08.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,well.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.15,1:17:17.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是过去的事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was yesterday,you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.49,1:17:23.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道吗?  孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know,kid...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.82,1:17:26.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得你跟我说欺骗的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}remember you were telling me a long time ago about deceptions...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.63,1:17:30.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟你说小心耍诈吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I was tellin' you about scams?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.30,1:17:32.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我应该听你的才对  我却反而对你说教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should've listened to you. I was trying to teach you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.90,1:17:36.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你却教了我 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right? But you were teaching me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.47,1:17:39.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我却不听  我当时不知道我犯了错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I didn't wise up. I didn't know and I made mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.91,1:17:42.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做了...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I do things...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.60,1:17:50.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那使我耿耿于怀  我会忘记很多事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It bothers me that I forget a lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.37,1:18:06.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道自己做错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know I made a few mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.40,1:18:08.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我希望能再跟你一起 But\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would love to hang out with you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.94,1:18:11.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有你和我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just you and me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.28,1:18:17.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我发誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear to God...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.95,1:18:20.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次只有你和我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's just gonna be you and me this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.75,1:18:24.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,家族队?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home team?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.96,1:18:30.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  家族队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Home team.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.70,1:18:34.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 孩子  你想听个笑话吗?  - 当然  说来听听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kid,you wanna hear a joke? - Sure. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.37,1:18:35.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 敲敲门  - 哪位?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Knock,knock. - Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.44,1:18:40.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 鲔鱼  - 鲔鱼什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tuna fish. - Tuna fish who?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.11,1:18:44.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,钢琴可以调音  鱼不能调\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can tune a piano,but you cannot tune a fish.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.71,1:18:45.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有进步了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gettin' better.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.76,1:18:48.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  这个笑话不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,that's a good one.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.03,1:19:02.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把门关上  小孩藏好  决战时刻来临了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lock the door and hide the kids. It's time to wage war!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.50,1:19:05.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤米·甘是洛奇的得意门生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tommy Gunn is said to be such a student of Rocky Balboa's style...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.97,1:19:10.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,报界为他取绰号为复制突击队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he's been nicknamed by the press "The Clone Ranger."
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.27,1:19:14.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轻松点  洛奇  他不值得你紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relax. He ain't worth the stress.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.04,1:19:16.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保罗  不是他的关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It ain't him,Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.68,1:19:18.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,力量有如涡轮增压机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turbo charged!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.75,1:19:24.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤米·"机关枪"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tommy "The Machine" Gunn!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.09,1:19:29.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来观众对于汤米...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like the fans are unhappy with Tommy Gunn...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.46,1:19:32.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对洛奇忘恩负义之举有些不满\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for leaving Rocky Balboa behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.90,1:19:36.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了  这小子人见人厌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course. He's nobody's sweetheart,that kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.40,1:19:40.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,体重是令人印象深刻的242磅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At 242 very impressive pounds...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.94,1:19:44.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现任世界重量级拳王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the present world heavyweight champion...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.74,1:19:47.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尤尼·肯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Union Cane!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.58,1:19:50.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保罗  他的状况似乎很棒?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like he's in great shape,don't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.75,1:19:54.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裁判将选手叫至场中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The referee calling both fighters...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.59,1:19:58.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看汤米  他有点紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa,Tommy's lookin' a little tight. He's nervous,you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.86,1:20:01.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他很紧张  就像我和阿波罗比赛的感觉一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like the way I felt when I was fightin' with Apollo.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.43,1:20:04.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  那小子不是你 他永远比不上你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He ain't you. Hardly ever was,that kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.40,1:20:09.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样  给他个机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give him a break,would you?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.31,1:20:15.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤米  照我教你的打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do what you was told.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.41,1:20:19.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前后跳跃  左右闪躲  避开他的刺拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In and out,side to side. Don't eat the jab.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.85,1:20:21.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快离开绳子  你瞎了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Off the ropes! You blind?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.98,1:20:24.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他这样会被修理的很惨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gettin' hit with everything but the ring posts.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.25,1:20:27.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快  肯恩  修理他  加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's rumble. Go for it,Cane.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.97,1:20:32.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小子  你是怎么搞的?  就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,Tommy. What's the matter with you? That's it!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.37,1:20:41.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出刺拳  移动  左右闪躲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slip the jab. Move side to side.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.14,1:20:44.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像节拍器一样来回移动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back and forth like a metronome. Side to side.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.55,1:20:48.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.89,1:21:02.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看  他全部都记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see,he remembers everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.80,1:21:06.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤米  加油  我就在你身旁  照我的打法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. I'm in there. Do what I'm doin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.54,1:21:10.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,照我的打法  来回移动  左右闪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do what I'm doin'. Side to side!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.57,1:21:19.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要让他还手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let him up!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.77,1:21:22.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重击...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roll! Roll! Roll!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.13,1:21:29.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摆平他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dig! Dig!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.23,1:21:40.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重量级拳王肯恩被击倒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The heavyweight champion Cane is down!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.24,1:21:45.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一  二  三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One! Two! Three!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.57,1:21:48.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四  五\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four! Five!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.21,1:21:49.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,六  七\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six! Seven!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.85,1:21:52.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,八  九\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eight Nine!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.06,1:21:56.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十  你输了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten! You're out!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.16,1:22:08.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位女士先生  以击倒取胜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen,by way of a knockout...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.19,1:22:09.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新拳王产生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we have a new champion...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.73,1:22:12.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤米·"机关枪"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tommy "The Machine" Gunn!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.50,1:22:19.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜  你赢得嘘声如雷的胜利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations. A sensational upset victory!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.30,1:22:22.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身为新任拳王有何感想?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're now the champion of the world. How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.24,1:22:25.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我太高兴了  我不知道这些人是怎么搞的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never better. I don't know what's wrong with these people...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.28,1:22:30.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你不是冠军  只是个杂碎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you're not a champion. You're a crumb-bum dirtbag.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.68,1:22:35.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,饶了他吧  他表现得很棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give him a break. He's doin' something wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.75,1:22:38.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 拳王万岁  - 我要感谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Long live the king! - I'd like to thank the man...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.06,1:22:40.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,促成这一切的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who made this happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.93,1:22:44.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要感谢他让我相信这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to thank the man who made me believe all this could happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.80,1:22:49.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就像我肩上的天使  乔治·华盛顿·杜克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man who's been like an angel on my shoulder,Mr. George Washington Duke!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.54,1:22:53.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界新任拳王终于诞生了 汤米·"机关枪"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you have it,a new world champion,Tommy "The Machine" Gunn.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.91,1:22:58.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉各位  至少令我意外的是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a big surprise,at least to me,that the new champion...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.45,1:23:01.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他竟然感谢杜克而非提拔他的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thanked Duke instead of the guy that got him here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.08,1:23:06.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现场观众并不高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This crowd is unhappy. The only person...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.05,1:23:09.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky! Rocky!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.56,1:23:13.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 看太多电视对眼睛有害  - 我的眼睛没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Too much TV is bad for the eyes. - My eyes are okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.73,1:23:16.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看太多电视对耳朵不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too much TV is bad for my ears.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.27,1:23:21.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 小鬼  比赛很精彩吧?  - 爸  还好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi,slugger. Good fight,huh? - It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.01,1:23:25.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你才是真正的冠军  我为你做了这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the real champ around here. I made this for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.38,1:23:27.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.48,1:23:30.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去喝啤酒  好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's put our teeth around a few brews,okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.02,1:23:34.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我想找人陪陪  - 好主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I could use the company. - Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.55,1:23:37.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我必须和保罗叔叔出去吗?  - 如果我可以看电视的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Should I go out with Uncle Paulie? - If I can watch TV.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.66,1:23:40.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的  听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.66,1:23:44.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以看电视  但是别太晚睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can watch TV,but don't stay up too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.30,1:23:47.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 让骨头好好增长  - 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You gotta get them bones growin'. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.50,1:23:49.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比赛真精彩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a fight. It was somethin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.87,1:23:52.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真精彩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somethin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.01,1:23:55.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我早说过  除了你  你什么都能给他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you you could give him everything but you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.03,1:23:56.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是没法给他你的心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't give him your heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.78,1:24:00.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无所谓  艾莉  真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay,really.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.05,1:24:04.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的  我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.35,1:24:08.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿  孩子  别太晚睡  好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kid,don't stay up too late,okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.26,1:24:10.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那场比赛真精彩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was some fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.22,1:24:12.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.06,1:24:15.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.00,1:24:18.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会待太晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't be out too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.07,1:24:20.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待会见  小拳王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you,champ.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.71,1:24:26.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了  和保罗好好去玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have a good time with Uncle Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.91,1:24:32.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女士们  先生们  让我介绍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen,let me present the newest...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.42,1:24:35.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳击史上最年轻的重量级拳王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the youngest heavyweight champion of all time...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.45,1:24:39.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤米·"机关枪"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tommy "The Machine" Gunn!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.15,1:24:41.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认为这场比赛太容易吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was the fight too easy?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.16,1:24:43.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他打了我几拳  不过我没受伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He gave me a few good shots,but I was never hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.16,1:24:45.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很高兴我当上拳王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just glad to be the champ!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.30,1:24:50.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不觉得根本不像冠军赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you think this looked more like a sparring session...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.46,1:24:53.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反而像练拳吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}instead of a championship match?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.47,1:24:57.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你根本不费吹灰之力  - 你观察很敏锐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Didn't look like you broke a sweat. - Very observant.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.04,1:24:59.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯恩身体不适  就算肯恩没生病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Union Cane wasn't feelin' good,but Tommy would've done the same thing...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.08,1:25:01.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤米一样能战胜他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if Union was 100 percent!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.01,1:25:06.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他打起来连吃奶的力气都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One hundred percent? He fought like he didn't have a heartbeat!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.68,1:25:09.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们都知道肯恩是纸老虎  - 你说这句话是什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cane is just a paper champion. - What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.95,1:25:13.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的头衔是捏造的  他从未击败过洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cane's title was manufactured. He never won it from Balboa.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.15,1:25:15.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尤尼·肯恩是货真价实的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get aboard. Union Cane is for real.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.06,1:25:18.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能走出洛奇的阴影吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think you'll ever get out from Rocky Balboa's shadow?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.86,1:25:23.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我赢了  还要我怎样?  - 我来告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I won the title! What more must I do? - I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.03,1:25:26.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你得找真正的对手才行  - 我今晚了打败拳王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You've got to fight real opponents. - I beat the best tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.77,1:25:29.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳王? 那窝囊废根本不配\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The best? This guy's a bum. He doesn't deserve a shot at the title.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.34,1:25:32.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位  我们扯太远了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen,whoa. We're getting carried away.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.04,1:25:34.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯恩是公认的拳王  下一个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Union Cane was the recognized champ. Next question.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.95,1:25:37.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们知道成绩是可以幕后操纵的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know the rating system can be manipulated.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.85,1:25:40.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结论就是汤米击败一个二流选手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bottom line is,Tommy Gunn beat a second-rate fighter...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.39,1:25:43.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他嘴里的玻璃可以作盏吊灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with so much glass in his jaw he ought to be a chandelier.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.16,1:25:47.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会证明自己是个拳王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say what you want,but this man will prove to be a great champion.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.86,1:25:51.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他可能会赢几场比赛  但是绝不可能击败洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He might win a few fights,but a Rocky Balboa he'll never be.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.80,1:25:53.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是洛奇  洛奇只有一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,no,he's no Rocky Balboa. There's only one Balboa.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.90,1:25:56.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇才是真正的拳王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balboa was a true people's champion.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.27,1:26:02.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤米很快便能取代他的地位  下一个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But in time,Tommy Gunn may be able to fill his shoes. Next question.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.28,1:26:05.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别找肯恩这种三流货色  - 我会出战任何人  任何时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Not fighting stiffs like Cane! - I'll fight anybody,anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.01,1:26:08.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁?  你何时才要打真正的拳赛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who? When? When you gonna fight a real fight?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.55,1:26:12.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位  好了  谢谢大驾光临  下次再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen,come on. Thank you for coming tonight. We look forward to seeing you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.09,1:26:14.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤米  我有个建议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tommy,I got something for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.66,1:26:17.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一场何不跟红发妞打好了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For your next fight,why not fight the redhead in the front row?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.99,1:26:21.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听说她价码很低  怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hear she comes real cheap. What about that?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.10,1:26:26.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们下一场比赛再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We look forward to seeing you at Tommy Gunn's next fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.20,1:26:27.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么说洛奇比较强?  你也这么想吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you say Balboa was better? Do you believe he's better?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.67,1:26:29.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你才是冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You champ! You champ!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.94,1:26:32.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤米  你下一场跟谁比赛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who you gonna fight for the next fight,Tommy?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.94,1:26:35.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才是怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell happened in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.38,1:26:38.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我赢了还被他们讥笑为蹩脚货\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won the title and these people think I'm a bum!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.58,1:26:41.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你为何不支持我?  - 记者说的没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why didn't you take up for me? - When the press is right,they're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.55,1:26:43.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和洛奇一样行  我不在乎他们说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm as good as Balboa ever was! I don't give a damn what they say!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.59,1:26:46.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我厌倦被人称为机器人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm tired of being called a robot,too!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.29,1:26:50.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你斗不过新闻界  我也斗不过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't fight the press! I can't fight the press!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.23,1:26:53.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要他们无法忘怀洛奇 他永远都是拳王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As long as they've got Balboa on the brain,he'll always be champ.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.23,1:26:54.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他纵横拳击场一生 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man fought wars in the ring.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.92,1:26:56.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只是他的影子  没办法走出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're in his shadow with no way out.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.50,1:26:58.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 连你自己都这么说  - 不  听好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Listen to your own man talking. - No,no. Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.50,1:27:01.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有办法让你得到尊敬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a way to get the respect you deserve...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.84,1:27:04.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你必须要挑战洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you've got to challenge Balboa to fight man to man.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.04,1:27:06.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔治可以在海外安排这场比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}George could set this fight up abroad in weeks.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.05,1:27:08.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这将是有史以来最伟大的拳赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'd be the greatest fight ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.42,1:27:12.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老师对抗学生  老拳王对抗新拳王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Teacher against student. Old lion against young lion.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.69,1:27:14.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信我  只有这么做才能心安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the only way you'll get peace of mind. Believe me when I tell you...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.86,1:27:17.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,否则新闻界会一辈子  拿你与洛奇作文章\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that press will hound you with that man's legend...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.19,1:27:19.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要你还打拳的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for as long as you wear boxing gloves.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.73,1:27:22.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定要挑战他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta get him into that ring...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.20,1:27:25.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,否则一辈子都要面对同样问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or you'll be hearing questions like tonight for the rest of your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.07,1:27:28.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会问自己  我能击败他吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you'll start to ask yourself,"Could I take him?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.40,1:27:32.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的够好吗?  人们真以为我只是复制品吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I good enough? Do people think I'm a cheap carbon copy...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.47,1:27:34.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是因为肤色 才有机会的二流货色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or a second-rate pretender who only got a shot because of my skin tone?"
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.91,1:27:37.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定要向他挑战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got to challenge that man to fight,Tommy Gunn.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.62,1:27:44.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他拒绝  你就羞辱他  咄咄逼人  践踏他的自尊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if he refuses,you've got to insult him! Dog him! Humiliate him!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.42,1:27:45.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用尽一切手段逼他上场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do whatever you've got to do to get him into that ring...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.26,1:27:47.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你非这么做不可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but that's what you've got to do!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.90,1:27:54.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  开球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay,blast off.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.50,1:27:56.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,银球滚动  下去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rollin' silver. And now...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.97,1:28:00.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪  挡球杆坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute! The flippers ain't flippin'! Andy!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.44,1:28:03.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那机器花了我不少钱  - 我也花了不少钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That machine cost me a fortune. - It's costin' me a fortune,too.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.94,1:28:07.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 洛奇·巴尔博亚   - 是谁在鬼叫?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rocky Balboa! - What was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.75,1:28:14.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  外面有个人有话对你说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky Balboa,there's a man out here wishing to speak with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.59,1:28:17.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道是谁吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know who that is?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.79,1:28:20.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  我知道是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,I know who that is.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.69,1:28:23.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  需要帮忙吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky,need some help?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.87,1:28:29.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用  又不是大食客比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,guys. This ain't no pie eating contest.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.24,1:28:32.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看  瞧瞧街上是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look what's in the street.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.64,1:28:35.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来这里干嘛?  你应该去开庆功宴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tommy,what are you doin' here? You ought to be out celebrating.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.71,1:28:38.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我向你挑战  任何时间地点都行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm challenging you to a fight anytime,anyplace,anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.41,1:28:41.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 拳赛?  - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fight? - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.02,1:28:45.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你带这些人来这里  问我想不想和你打拳?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You coming here with these people asking if I want to throw hands with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.05,1:28:47.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 就只是为了这个? - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is that what this is about? - Yeah,that's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.32,1:28:50.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是别人的机器人或傀儡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm nobody's robot! Nobody's boy!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.43,1:28:53.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要接受挑战或你只是孬种?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You accept the challenge,or are you yellow?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.40,1:28:57.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他没水准  洛奇  算了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has no class. Come on,Rock.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.07,1:29:02.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他没水准  - 他是蹩脚货\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He has no class! - He couldn't carry your shoes.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.01,1:29:07.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信这小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe this guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.85,1:29:12.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保罗  不关他的事  想不想打撞球?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paulie,it ain't him. You wanna shoot some eight ball?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.61,1:29:14.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我话还没说完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't through talking with you!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.48,1:29:16.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对你无话可说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't got no more to say to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.55,1:29:19.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只希望你一切顺利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want good things for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.49,1:29:21.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你这么做只是为了钱  - 为了钱?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're only in this for the money! - Money?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.76,1:29:24.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我厌倦了活在你的阴影下  人们骂我是你的机器人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm tired of walking around in your shadow. People call me your robot.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.86,1:29:27.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤米  你认为我是为了钱?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You thought I was in this for the money?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.23,1:29:30.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们情同手足\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were supposed to be like brothers.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.50,1:29:33.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得吗?  你不要被人耍了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't remember that? You got a deception going here.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.34,1:29:35.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这傢伙只是在利用你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This guy here was using you for the bait.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.87,1:29:38.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想刺激我们俩拳头相向   你明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants to get you and me in the ring.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.51,1:29:41.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他才好大捞一票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants us to fight each other to make the money.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.51,1:29:44.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他根本不关心你我的生死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He don't care about you or me neither.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.75,1:29:48.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够了  少说空话  谈现实问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Enough of the fantasy. Let's talk reality.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.52,1:29:53.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  你接受汤米的挑战吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky Balboa,are you prepared to accept Tommy Gunn's challenge?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.23,1:29:55.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我随时都能击败你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would've taken you anytime.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.23,1:29:57.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道吗  你只是一堆废物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a piece of garbage,you know that?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.16,1:30:00.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不关你的事  - 不关我的事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This ain't none of your business. - Ain't none of my business?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.17,1:30:02.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不关我的事?  - 算了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- None of my business? - Forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.94,1:30:06.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他为你费尽心血  把你放在他家人之上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man spit blood for you. He put you ahead of his family.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.37,1:30:09.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你却带这帮鼠辈来羞辱他?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you bring these rat bums around here and kill his dignity?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.91,1:30:13.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是洛奇给你机会的  他才是真正的冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky made you your shot. He's the real champ.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.58,1:30:17.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只不过是则笑话而已  快滚  免得我打烂你的脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're just a goddamn joke. Get out of here before I break...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.05,1:30:19.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保罗  你怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paulie! What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.96,1:30:21.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打他值得吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Break your hand on this bum,what are you worth then?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.86,1:30:23.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.86,1:30:26.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你当初不该收留他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should've left him on the street where you found him.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.00,1:30:37.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你给我出去  - 你给我出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get off of me,man! - Get him out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.51,1:30:41.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打倒他  何不试试打倒我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You knocked him down. Why don't you try knocking me down?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.28,1:30:42.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在拳击场  汤米只在拳击场上打  我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the ring. Tommy Gunn only fights in the ring! Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.78,1:30:44.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的拳击场就在街上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My ring's outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.42,1:30:49.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗?  来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.99,1:30:53.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现场转播\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go live! Go live!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.50,1:31:00.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  好好修理他  他是废物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take him quick. He's a punk.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.13,1:31:02.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇只配在街上混  你可是职业拳击手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balboa's a street fighter. You're a prizefighter!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.80,1:31:06.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别傻了  - 我不是属于你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't be a fool! - You don't own me!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.61,1:31:09.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不属于你  不属于任何人  - 别激动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You don't own me! Nobody does! - Take it easy
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.84,1:31:13.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我要该有的尊敬  - 那就来争取 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I want my respect! - Come and get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.69,1:31:16.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他是个三流货 好好教训他一顿  - 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's a bum! Take him out. - Come on,Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.16,1:31:29.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你  你知道吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I loved you,man. Do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.50,1:31:31.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤米  我们原本该情同手足的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and me was supposed to be like this,Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.57,1:31:34.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你却翻脸无情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You blew it!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.81,1:31:37.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.38,1:31:46.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,运气好罢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucky punch!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.38,1:31:49.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他只配在街上混  我告诉过你别在街上打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he's a street fighter,and I told you never to fight a street fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.32,1:31:51.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧  快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get out of here. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.26,1:31:53.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  你永远都是拳王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're always the champ,Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.29,1:32:32.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了  好题材\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is great stuff! Beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.13,1:32:38.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 爸上电视了  他在打拳   - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's Dad! He's on TV! He's fighting. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.80,1:32:40.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来  快出手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,man!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.70,1:32:48.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  现在谁才是傀儡?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balboa,who's your puppet now?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.58,1:33:07.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你一定要起来  - 站起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You gotta get up. - Get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.92,1:33:29.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你输了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're out!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.26,1:33:32.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死的就去死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he dies,he dies.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.73,1:33:37.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是拳王  起来再打一回合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the champ. Get up. One more round.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.44,1:33:41.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站起来  别放弃  努力奋战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up! Don't lay down! Fight hard!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.17,1:33:44.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是机器  我没听见钟声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's no machine. I didn't hear no bell!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.99,1:33:51.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起来  你这个混蛋  米克爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up,you son of a bitch! Mickey loves you.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.23,1:34:08.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没听见钟声响起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't hear no bell.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.27,1:34:10.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再一回合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One more round.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.64,1:34:13.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤米  回来  你大可不必\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tommy,get back. You don't need this.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.07,1:34:16.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你要是输就完蛋了  - 我还有一回合  来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You lose,you're finished. - I got one more round. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.75,1:34:21.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次我不要击倒你 我要打得你满街爬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not gonna knock you out this time. I'm gonna put you to the street.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.68,1:34:24.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再一回合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One more round.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.55,1:34:28.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,Rocky! Come on,Rock!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.70,1:35:00.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  汤米  快出拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,get it!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.91,1:35:15.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你敢碰我  我就告你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Touch me and I'll sue.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.14,1:35:25.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这是干什么?  快起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What in the hell you doin'? Get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.33,1:35:51.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打死那个混蛋  他夺走了我的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knock that bum out! He took my room!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.40,1:35:54.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刺拳  快出拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jab!Jab!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.67,1:35:59.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你快输光了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're losing everything!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.80,1:36:32.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸  你能打赢他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,Dad. You can beat him!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.48,1:36:38.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快还击  你这个窝囊废\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fight back,you bum!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.82,1:36:45.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸  加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad,go for it!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.99,1:36:58.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,揍他 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.92,1:37:21.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉  你说得对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adrian,you were right.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.72,1:37:26.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.06,1:37:31.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有美国才会发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only in America.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.62,1:37:41.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  你击败了那个蹩脚货?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,Rock. You outclassed the bum,huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.04,1:37:48.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.05,1:37:52.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你敢碰我  我就告你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Touch me and I'll sue.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.77,1:37:57.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  杂碎  敢碰我就告你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,pug. Touch me and I'll sue.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.09,1:38:10.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告我什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sue me for what?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.85,1:38:19.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo,Father.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.42,1:38:24.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就喜欢他这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love it when he does that.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.93,1:38:42.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点  我们快赶不上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna be late.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.64,1:38:46.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快  飞毛腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,Speedy Gonzalez!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.88,1:38:52.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 爸  你可以更棒的  - 不行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You can do better than that. - No way.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.23,1:38:58.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些台阶好像越来越高  真要命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. These steps keep growing taller every year. My goodness!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.56,1:39:01.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子  你看这铜像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this thing,kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.06,1:39:05.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要铜像在  鸽子就有地方休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As long as this thing is here,pigeons will always have a place to sit.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.45,1:39:08.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信  这里就是我起家的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe it. This is where it all started for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.95,1:39:11.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在台阶上来回奔跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Running up and down these steps.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.84,1:39:13.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸  我们要迟到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad,we're gonna be late.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.86,1:39:15.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.38,1:39:18.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 等一下  你耳朵怎么了?  - 有什么不对? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's wrong with your ear? - What's wrong with it?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.74,1:39:21.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你耳朵上有东西  肿起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got something growing,like a bump.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.82,1:39:22.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么肿起来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What bump?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.00,1:39:26.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This bump.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.15,1:39:30.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢  爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks,Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.25,1:39:33.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应得的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,you deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.25,1:39:35.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感谢上天赐你给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for being born.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.30,1:39:36.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you,thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.52,1:39:39.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认为如何?  全新的我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think? The new me?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.24,1:39:44.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就像我梦寐以求的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,you look like the daughter that I always wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.27,1:39:45.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你胡说什么? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talkin' about?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.65,1:39:49.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别打我  我骨头快散了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't punch me. I'm gettin' brittle as it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.44,1:39:50.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.76,1:39:53.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在这里跑步二十年了...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been running up and down these steps for 20 years...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.67,1:39:57.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟从不知道馆内有名画\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I never knew there was valuable pictures in this building.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.31,1:39:59.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,活到老学到老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're never too old to learn something new.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.09,1:40:01.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会爱死毕加索的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna love Picasso.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.53,1:40:04.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  我什么人都爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,well I love almost everybody.
